window.ACP_Q=[{"id":"120.1.1-e01","sec":"120.1.1","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A contractor was added to the Developers project role but reports that they can't log in to Jira at all. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"一位外包人員被加進 Developers project role，卻回報完全無法登入 Jira。最可能的原因？","zo":["外包人員沒有 Jira 的 product access","外包人員不在 jira-administrators group","Permission scheme 沒有把 Browse Projects 給 Developers","外包人員需要 Browse users and groups 全域權限"],"fig":"","opts":["The contractor lacks Jira product access","The contractor isn't in the jira-administrators group","The permission scheme lacks Browse Projects for Developers","The contractor needs the Browse users and groups global permission"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。沒有 Jira 的 product access（app 存取），project role 與 permission 都無法讓人進入 Jira。","B":"錯。一般使用者不需要 admin group。","C":"錯。缺 Browse 會看不到 project，但仍能登入 Jira。","D":"錯。這個權限只影響能看到哪些使用者。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/remove-or-suspend-a-user/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.1-e02","sec":"120.1.1","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An employee is going on a three-month leave and should regain the exact same groups and roles when they return, without being billed in between. What should the admin do?","zh":"一位員工要請三個月假，回來時要恢復完全相同的 group 與角色，期間不要計費。Admin 應該怎麼做？","zo":["移除使用者，之後再邀請","暫停（suspend）使用者存取，之後再還原","刪除使用者的 Atlassian 帳號","把使用者從所有 group 移除"],"fig":"","opts":["Remove the user and re-invite later","Suspend the user's access and restore it later","Delete the user's Atlassian account","Remove the user from all groups"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Remove 後要重新邀請，角色與 group 都要重設。","B":"對。官方：suspend 不計費；restore 後角色與 group 自動恢復。","C":"錯。刪除帳號是永久的。","D":"錯。手動移除 group 之後還要手動加回，而且仍可能計費（若仍有 app 存取）。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/remove-or-suspend-a-user/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.1-e03","sec":"120.1.1","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"An admin deletes the 'contractors' group. What is the impact? (Choose two.)","zh":"Admin 刪除了「contractors」group。影響為何？（選兩個）","zo":["Permission scheme 中透過這個 group 給的權限不再生效","使用者仍留在 organization","所有用到這個 group 的 project 被刪除","下次登入時 group 會自動重建","Group 裡的使用者被從 organization 刪除"],"fig":"","opts":["Permissions granted through the group in permission schemes stop applying","The users remain in the organization","All projects using the group are deleted","The group is automatically recreated at next login","The users in the group are deleted from the organization"],"ans":"AB","why":{"A":"對。用該 group 設定的權限（permission scheme、global permission 等）都會失效。","B":"對。使用者仍在 organization。","C":"錯。不會刪除 project。","D":"錯。不會自動重建。","E":"錯。官方：刪 group 不會把使用者移出 organization。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/delete-a-group/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.1-e04","sec":"120.1.1","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Acme verified the domain acme.com. Jane uses jane@acme.com but her account hasn't been claimed. What is Jane's account type, and what can Acme do?","zh":"Acme 已驗證 acme.com 網域。Jane 使用 jane@acme.com，但帳號尚未被 claim。Jane 的帳號是什麼類型？Acme 能做什麼？","zo":["External user；Acme 不能修改她的帳號資料，也不能刪除她的帳號","Managed account；Acme 可以改她的 email","Guest；Acme 只能看她的活動","Managed account；Acme 可以刪除它"],"fig":"","opts":["External user; Acme can't update her account details or delete her account","Managed account; Acme can change her email","Guest; Acme can only view her activity","Managed account; Acme can delete it"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：要驗證 domain 並 claim 帳號才是 managed；Jane 是 external user，admin 可以邀請、移除，但不能改帳號資料或刪帳號。","B":"錯。不是 managed，不能改 email。","C":"錯。不是 guest 的概念。","D":"錯。沒有 claim 就不是 managed。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/what-are-managed-accounts/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.1-e05","sec":"120.1.1","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A company-managed project must allow people who aren't logged in to browse its issues. What is required?","zh":"某個 company-managed project 必須讓未登入的人也能瀏覽 issue。需要什麼？","zo":["把匿名 group 加到 Users role","在 permission scheme 把 Browse Projects 給 Public（Anyone on the web）","把 Browse users and groups 給所有人","改成 team-managed 並用 Open access"],"fig":"","opts":["Add the anonymous group to the Users role","Grant Browse Projects to Public (Anyone on the web) in the permission scheme","Grant Browse users and groups to anyone","Convert the project to team-managed with Open access"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。沒有「anonymous group」可以加。","B":"對。匿名存取是在 permission scheme 把 Browse Projects 給 Public。","C":"錯。這個全域權限只影響看得到哪些使用者。","D":"錯。TMP 的 Open 只對站上使用者，TMP 不支援匿名存取。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/prevent-or-remove-public-access/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.1-e06","sec":"120.1.1","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"How is a user typically given access to Jira Software?","zh":"通常如何讓使用者取得 Jira 的存取？","zo":["給他 Browse Projects 權限","讓他擔任 project lead","把他加進 project role","給他 Jira 的 app user 角色，也就是把他加進該 app 的 default access group"],"fig":"","opts":["By giving them the Browse Projects permission","By making them a project lead","By adding them to a project role","By granting the Jira app user role, which adds them to the app's default access group"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Browse Projects 是 project 權限，前提是已有 product access。","B":"錯。Project lead 是 project 欄位，不給授權。","C":"錯。Project role 不給產品存取。","D":"對。給 app 角色＝加進該角色的 default group；也可直接把人加進那個 group。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/give-users-admin-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.1-e07","sec":"120.1.1","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Employees using the company email domain should be able to join Jira on their own without an admin inviting each person. What should be configured?","zh":"使用公司 email 網域的員工，應能自行加入 Jira，不必 admin 逐一邀請。應設定什麼？","zo":["公開的 permission scheme","把 Browse users and groups 給所有人","新的 project role","Approved domains，並自動給 product access"],"fig":"","opts":["A public permission scheme","Browse users and groups for everyone","A new project role","Approved domains with automatic product access"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。公開 permission scheme 是匿名瀏覽，不是讓員工加入。","B":"錯。這是看使用者名單的權限。","C":"錯。Role 不處理加入站台。","D":"對。Approved domains 讓同一 domain 的人自助加入並取得指定的 app 存取。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/give-users-admin-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.1-e08","sec":"120.1.1","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Before deleting an unused group, what should an admin check?","zh":"刪除一個看似沒用的 group 之前，admin 應檢查什麼？","zo":["這個 group 是否用於 permission scheme、global permission 或其他設定","Group 名稱是否超過 20 字","是否有 dashboard 被加星號","什麼都不用，刪除 group 沒有影響"],"fig":"","opts":["Whether the group is used in permission schemes, global permissions, or other configurations","Whether the group name is longer than 20 characters","Whether any dashboards are starred","Nothing; deleting groups has no impact"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：刪除前先確認 group 是否用於權限設定；若成員仍需權限就不要刪，否則先移除權限。","B":"錯。名稱長度無關。","C":"錯。Star 是個人偏好。","D":"錯。會影響所有用到該 group 的設定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/delete-a-group/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.1-e09","sec":"120.1.1","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements about removing a user from an organization are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"關於把使用者移出 organization，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["要恢復存取，必須重新邀請並重新指定 group 與角色","其 Atlassian 帳號在所有地方被永久刪除","30 天內保留所有 group 成員資格","只有 project admin 能移除使用者","該使用者不再計費"],"fig":"","opts":["To reinstate access, the user must be invited again and their groups and roles reassigned","Their Atlassian account is permanently deleted everywhere","They keep all group memberships for 30 days","Only project admins can remove users","The user is no longer billed"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。官方：要重新邀請並重新指定角色與 group。","B":"錯。不會永久刪除 Atlassian 帳號，也不影響其他 organization。","C":"錯。沒有這種保留期。","D":"錯。是 org admin（或 user access admin）的工作。","E":"對。移除後不再計費。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/remove-or-suspend-a-user/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.2-e10","sec":"120.1.2","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira admin (with Administer Jira) is asked to invite five new users to the site. What is true?","zh":"有 Administer Jira 的 Jira admin 被要求邀請五位新使用者到站台。何者正確？","zo":["Administer Jira 不能管理使用者；要由 organization admin（或 user access admin）處理","只有 project admin 能邀請使用者","Jira admin 要先建立 project","Jira admin 可以從 Jira settings 完成"],"fig":"","opts":["Administer Jira doesn't allow managing users; an organization admin (or user access admin) must do it","Only project admins can invite users","The Jira admin must first create a project","The Jira admin can do it from Jira settings"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。管理使用者是 org admin 或 user access admin 的工作。","B":"錯。Project admin 不能邀請新使用者到站台。","C":"錯。與建立 project 無關。","D":"錯。官方：Administer Jira 不能管理現有使用者或新增使用者。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.2-e11","sec":"120.1.2","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Who can make another user an organization admin?","zh":"誰能把另一位使用者設為 organization admin？","zo":["Jira admin","Organization admin","Project admin","Site admin"],"fig":"","opts":["A Jira admin","An organization admin","A project admin","A site admin"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Jira admin 無權指派任何 Atlassian Administration 角色。","B":"對。只有 org admin 能新增或管理其他 org admin。","C":"錯。Project admin 只管自己的 project。","D":"錯。Site admin 不能指派 org admin。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/what-are-the-different-types-of-admin-roles/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.2-e12","sec":"120.1.2","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An organization admin opens Jira settings but can't edit workflows. What is the most likely reason?","zh":"Organization admin 打開 Jira settings，卻不能編輯 workflow。最可能的原因？","zo":["他需要 Browse users and groups 權限","Org admin 永遠不能存取 Jira","他沒有把自己加進 jira-administrators（Jira admin）group","Workflow 只能由 project admin 編輯"],"fig":"","opts":["They need the Browse users and groups permission","Org admins never have access to Jira","They haven't added themselves to the jira-administrators (Jira admin) group","Workflows can only be edited by project admins"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。與 workflow 無關。","B":"錯。Org admin 可以取得 Jira 存取。","C":"對。官方：org admin 或 site admin 要把自己加進 jira-administrators group 才有 Administer Jira。","D":"錯。CMP workflow 要 Jira admin。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.2-e13","sec":"120.1.2","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which actions can a project admin of a company-managed project perform? (Choose two.)","zh":"Company-managed project 的 project admin 能做哪些事？（選兩個）","zo":["建立新的 custom field","把使用者加進 project 的 role","建立並發布 version","編輯 project 的 permission scheme","修改 project key"],"fig":"","opts":["Create a new custom field","Add users to the project's roles","Create and release versions","Edit the project's permission scheme","Change the project key"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。Custom field 是全站物件，要 Jira admin。","B":"對。Project admin 管 People（role 成員）。","C":"對。Administer Projects 包含管理 versions 與 components。","D":"錯。Scheme 要 Jira admin。","E":"錯。改 key 要 org／site／Jira admin。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/permissions-for-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.2-e14","sec":"120.1.2","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"How is someone typically made a project admin in a company-managed project?","zh":"在 company-managed project，通常怎麼讓某人成為 project admin？","zo":["讓他成為 site admin","給他 Make bulk changes 全域權限","把他設為 default assignee","把他加進 permission scheme 中擁有 Administer Projects 的 role（例如 Administrators）"],"fig":"","opts":["Make them a site admin","Give them the Make bulk changes global permission","Set them as default assignee","Add them to the role (e.g., Administrators) that holds Administer Projects in the permission scheme"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Site admin 不會自動成為 project admin，也遠超需求。","B":"錯。Bulk change 與 project admin 無關。","C":"錯。Default assignee 只影響指派。","D":"對。Permission scheme 把 Administer Projects 給 Administrators role，再把人加進該 role。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/permissions-for-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.2-e15","sec":"120.1.2","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements about admin roles in Atlassian cloud are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"關於 Atlassian cloud 的 admin 角色，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["Jira admin 可以進入 Atlassian Administration","Project admin 可以刪除 group","Admin 角色不一定自動給 app 存取","User access admin 管理某個 app 的存取，但不會自動取得該 app 的存取","Site admin 可以指派 organization admin 角色"],"fig":"","opts":["Jira admins can access Atlassian Administration","Project admins can delete groups","Admin roles don't always give access to apps automatically","A user access admin manages access to a specific app but doesn't automatically get access to it","Site admins can assign the organization admin role"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。App admin 不能存取 Atlassian Administration。","B":"錯。刪 group 是 org admin 的工作。","C":"對。官方：admin 角色不一定自動給 app 存取。","D":"對。User access admin 管某 app 的使用者存取，自己不一定能用該 app。","E":"錯。只有 org admin 能指派 org admin。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/what-are-the-different-types-of-admin-roles/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.2-e16","sec":"120.1.2","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A site admin needs to back up the Jira site. A colleague with only Administer Jira offers to do it instead. What is true?","zh":"Site admin 要備份 Jira 站台。一位只有 Administer Jira 的同事說可以代勞。何者正確？","zo":["只有 project admin 能匯出資料","Jira Cloud 停用了備份","可以，因為 Administer Jira 包含匯入與匯出","Administer Jira 不包含匯入與匯出資料"],"fig":"","opts":["Only project admins can export data","Backups are disabled in Jira Cloud","The Jira admin can do it, because Administer Jira includes import and export","Administer Jira doesn't include importing and exporting data"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Project admin 不能做全站 backup。","B":"錯。Jira Cloud 有 backup manager。","C":"錯。官方：Administer Jira 不能匯入、匯出資料。","D":"對。Backup 與匯入屬站台／組織層級的管理工作。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.2-e17","sec":"120.1.2","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Only an organization admin can grant which role for Jira apps?","zh":"Jira apps 的哪一種角色只有 organization admin 能授予？","zo":["Jira Administration 的 app admin","Project admin","Team-managed project 的 Viewer role","Default assignee"],"fig":"","opts":["App admin for Jira Administration","Project admin","Viewer role in team-managed projects","Default assignee"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：只有 org admin 能讓其他使用者成為 Jira apps 的 app admin（Jira Administration）。","B":"錯。Project admin 由 role 成員決定。","C":"錯。TMP 的 role 由 project admin 管。","D":"錯。Default assignee 是 project 設定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/give-users-admin-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.3-e18","sec":"120.1.3","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira admin wants to give only Mia the ability to share dashboards. What must be done?","zh":"Jira admin 只想讓 Mia 能分享 dashboard。必須怎麼做？","zo":["把 Mia 加到 Administrators project role","給 Mia Make bulk changes 權限","直接把 Share dashboards and filters 給 Mia","把 Mia 放進一個 group，再把 Share dashboards and filters 給該 group"],"fig":"","opts":["Add Mia to the Administrators project role","Give Mia the Make bulk changes permission","Grant Share dashboards and filters directly to Mia","Put Mia in a group and grant Share dashboards and filters to that group"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Project role 不能拿到 global permission。","B":"錯。與分享無關。","C":"錯。Global permission 不能直接給個人。","D":"對。Global permission 只能給 group。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.3-e19","sec":"120.1.3","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Users can type a comment but @mention only shows people who can browse the current project, not everyone on the site. Which global permission are they missing?","zh":"使用者能打留言，但 @mention 只列出能瀏覽目前 project 的人，看不到全站使用者。他們缺哪個 global permission？","zo":["Share dashboards and filters","Manage group filter subscriptions","Administer Jira","Browse users and groups"],"fig":"","opts":["Share dashboards and filters","Manage group filter subscriptions","Administer Jira","Browse users and groups"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。分享權限。","B":"錯。訂閱權限。","C":"錯。與 @mention 範圍無關。","D":"對。沒有 Browse users and groups 的人只看得到在該 project 有 Browse 權限的使用者。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.3-e20","sec":"120.1.3","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team lead has Make bulk changes but can't bulk-transition issues in the Payroll project. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"某 team lead 有 Make bulk changes，卻不能在 Payroll project 批次轉換 issue。最可能的原因？","zo":["他需要 Administer Jira","他不是 project lead","Jira Cloud 停用了 bulk change","他在 Payroll 缺少所需的 project 權限（例如 Transition Issues）"],"fig":"","opts":["They need Administer Jira","They aren't the project lead","Bulk changes are disabled in Jira Cloud","They lack the project permission needed (e.g., Transition Issues) in Payroll"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。不需要 Jira admin。","B":"錯。Project lead 與權限無關。","C":"錯。功能存在。","D":"對。官方：bulk change 還需要必要的 project 權限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.3-e21","sec":"120.1.3","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The company wants to stop employees from creating their own projects, while Jira admins can still create any project. What should be changed?","zh":"公司想禁止一般員工自行建立 project，而 Jira admin 仍可建立任何 project。應修改什麼？","zo":["把 Create team-managed projects 從擁有它的 group 收回","把所有使用者的 Browse Projects 收回","收回 Jira admin 的 Administer Jira","停用 issue linking"],"fig":"","opts":["Remove Create team-managed projects from the groups that have it","Remove Browse Projects from all users","Remove Administer Jira from Jira admins","Disable issue linking"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。預設所有 Jira 使用者能建 TMP；收回這個 global permission 即可，CMP 本來就要 Administer Jira。","B":"錯。會讓大家看不到 project。","C":"錯。Jira admin 需要保留。","D":"錯。與建立 project 無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.3-e22","sec":"120.1.3","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which global permissions exist in Jira Cloud? (Choose two.)","zh":"哪些是 Jira Cloud 的 global permission？（選兩個）","zo":["Edit Issues","Manage group filter subscriptions","Make bulk changes","Browse Projects","Assign Issues"],"fig":"","opts":["Edit Issues","Manage group filter subscriptions","Make bulk changes","Browse Projects","Assign Issues"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。Project permission。","B":"對。Global permission。","C":"對。Global permission。","D":"錯。Project permission。","E":"錯。Project permission。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.3-e23","sec":"120.1.3","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user wants to create a filter subscription that emails the 'support' group every Monday. What does the user need?","zh":"使用者想建立每週一寄給「support」group 的 filter subscription。他需要什麼？","zo":["Administer Jira","Browse users and groups","Create team-managed projects","Manage group filter subscriptions"],"fig":"","opts":["Administer Jira","Browse users and groups","Create team-managed projects","Manage group filter subscriptions"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。不需要 Jira admin。","B":"錯。與訂閱無關。","C":"錯。與訂閱無關。","D":"對。訂閱給 group 需要這個 global permission。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.3-e24","sec":"120.1.3","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which actions does the Administer Jira global permission allow? (Choose two.)","zh":"Administer Jira 全域權限允許哪些動作？（選兩個）","zo":["匯入與匯出站台資料","建立 company-managed project","編輯 workflow 與 scheme","管理使用者與 group","編輯系統 email 設定"],"fig":"","opts":["Importing and exporting site data","Creating company-managed projects","Editing workflows and schemes","Managing users and groups","Editing system email settings"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。官方明列不能。","B":"對。建 CMP 與 TMP。","C":"對。改 issue type、欄位、workflow 與各種 scheme。","D":"錯。官方明列不能。","E":"錯。官方明列不能。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.3-e25","sec":"120.1.3","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In which order does access need to be satisfied for a user to see and transition an issue in a company-managed project?","zh":"在 company-managed project，使用者要看到並轉換一張 issue，存取關卡的順序是？","zo":["只看 global permissions","Product access → project 權限（Browse、Transition）→ workflow condition → issue security level","Issue security → product access → global permissions","Workflow condition → 只要 product access"],"fig":"","opts":["Global permissions only","Product access → project permissions (Browse, Transition) → workflow condition → issue security level","Issue security → product access → global permissions","Workflow condition → product access only"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Global permissions 不決定 project 內的動作。","B":"對。先要能進 Jira，再看 project 權限，transition 按鈕還受 workflow condition 影響，單張 issue 再受 security level 限制。","C":"錯。順序不對，也漏了 project 權限。","D":"錯。漏了 project 權限與 issue security。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/how-do-jira-permissions-work/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.4-e26","sec":"120.1.4","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Mia is a developer in the project, but she doesn't appear in the Assignee dropdown. Other developers do. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Mia 是 project 的開發者，但她沒有出現在 Assignee 下拉選單中，其他開發者都有。最可能的原因？","zo":["Mia 缺少 Assign Issues 權限","Mia 不是 project lead","Mia 缺少 Browse users and groups","Mia 缺少 Assignable User 權限"],"fig":"","opts":["Mia lacks the Assign Issues permission","Mia isn't the project lead","Mia lacks Browse users and groups","Mia lacks the Assignable User permission"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Assign Issues 是「指派別人」的權限，不決定她能不能被指派。","B":"錯。Project lead 與能否被指派無關。","C":"錯。這影響她看得到誰，不影響別人能否指派她。","D":"對。被指派的人要有 Assignable User。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/permissions-for-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.4-e27","sec":"120.1.4","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user has Move Issues in project A but can't move an issue to project B. What else is needed?","zh":"使用者在 project A 有 Move Issues，卻無法把 issue 移到 project B。還需要什麼？","zo":["Project B 的 Link Issues","Project B 的 Create Issues","Administer Jira","Project A 的 Delete Issues"],"fig":"","opts":["Link Issues in project B","Create Issues in project B","Administer Jira","Delete Issues in project A"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。與連結無關。","B":"對。移動等於在目標 project 建立，要有目標 project 的 Create Issues。","C":"錯。不需要 Jira admin。","D":"錯。移動不需要刪除權限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/permissions-for-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.4-e28","sec":"120.1.4","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Users have the Link Issues permission, but the 'Link' option doesn't appear on any issue. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"使用者有 Link Issues 權限，但所有 issue 都沒有「Link」選項。最可能的原因？","zo":["Link Issues 需要 Make bulk changes","在 Jira settings 全站停用了 issue linking","使用者缺少 Browse users and groups","使用者不是 project admin"],"fig":"","opts":["Link Issues requires Make bulk changes","Issue linking is disabled globally in Jira settings","The users lack Browse users and groups","The users aren't project admins"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。不需要 bulk change。","B":"對。全站關閉 issue linking 時，即使有 Link Issues 也看不到選項。","C":"錯。與連結無關。","D":"錯。一般使用者也能連結。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-issue-linking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.4-e29","sec":"120.1.4","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Twenty projects use the same permission scheme, but each project has different developers. What is the best way to grant Edit Issues?","zh":"20 個 project 使用同一個 permission scheme，但每個 project 的開發者不同。授予 Edit Issues 的最佳方式？","zo":["以 single user 逐一給每位開發者","給 Application access：Any logged in user","給 Developers project role，讓各 project admin 自行加入開發者","每個 project 建一個 group 與一個 scheme"],"fig":"","opts":["Grant it to each developer as a single user","Grant it to Application access: Any logged in user","Grant it to a Developers project role and let each project admin add their developers","Create a group per project and a scheme per project"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。難以維護，而且所有 project 都會給同一批人。","B":"錯。會讓所有登入者都能編輯。","C":"對。Role 讓同一個 scheme 用在多個 project，各 project 自己填成員。","D":"錯。可行但要維護 20 個 group 與 20 個 scheme。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-project-roles/","https://community.atlassian.com/t5/Jira-questions/Should-I-use-Project-Roles-or-Groups/qaq-p/1908851"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.4-e30","sec":"120.1.4","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In a change approval project, only the person in the 'Approver' user picker field should be able to transition the issue. Which grant achieves this?","zh":"在 change 核准的 project 中，只有「Approver」user picker 欄位中的人能轉換該 issue。哪個授權方式能達成？","zo":["Transition Issues 給 Group：approvers","Transition Issues 給 Project lead","Transition Issues 給 User custom field value：Approver","Transition Issues 給 Reporter"],"fig":"","opts":["Group: approvers for Transition Issues","Project lead for Transition Issues","User custom field value: Approver for Transition Issues","Reporter for Transition Issues"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Group 是固定名單，不是「這張 issue 的 approver」。","B":"錯。Project lead 是固定一人。","C":"對。User custom field value 讓權限跟著欄位裡的人走。","D":"錯。Reporter 是提出的人。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-project-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.4-e31","sec":"120.1.4","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements describe team-managed project access? (Choose two.)","zh":"哪些敘述符合 team-managed project 的存取？（選兩個）","zo":["用 Open、Limited、Private 加上 role 設定存取","Project admin 不需要 Jira admin 就能管理存取","由共用的 permission scheme 控制","Team-managed project 支援匿名存取","Role 會覆蓋（取代）access level"],"fig":"","opts":["Access is set with Open, Limited, or Private plus roles","Project admins manage access without a Jira admin","Access is controlled by a shared permission scheme","Team-managed projects support anonymous access","Roles override (replace) the access level"],"ans":"AB","why":{"A":"對。TMP 用 access level＋role。","B":"對。TMP 的 project admin 自己管。","C":"錯。TMP 沒有 permission scheme。","D":"錯。TMP 不支援匿名。","E":"錯。Role 是疊加的，不覆蓋 access level。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/next-gen-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-how-people-access-your-team-managed-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.4-e32","sec":"120.1.4","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Who can change the permission scheme associated with a company-managed project, and who can add users to that project's roles?","zh":"誰能更換 company-managed project 使用的 permission scheme？誰能把使用者加進該 project 的 role？","zo":["任何使用者；project lead","Jira admin；project admin","Project admin；Jira admin","只有 org admin；只有 org admin"],"fig":"","opts":["Any user; project lead","Jira admin; project admin","Project admin; Jira admin","Org admin only; org admin only"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。一般使用者不能。","B":"對。換或改 scheme 要 Jira admin；role 成員由 project admin 管理。","C":"錯。顛倒了。","D":"錯。不限 org admin。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-project-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.4-e33","sec":"120.1.4","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which permission lets a user change an issue's due date and rank?","zh":"哪個權限讓使用者能改 issue 的 due date 與排序？","zo":["Assign Issues","Resolve Issues","Schedule Issues","Edit Issues"],"fig":"","opts":["Assign Issues","Resolve Issues","Schedule Issues","Edit Issues"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。指派。","B":"錯。Resolution 與 fix version。","C":"對。Schedule Issues 管 due date 與排序。","D":"錯。Edit Issues 不含 due date。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/permissions-for-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.4-e34","sec":"120.1.4","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"All licensed Jira users should be able to view issues in an internal project, without adding them to roles. Which grant is appropriate for Browse Projects?","zh":"所有有 Jira 授權的使用者都應能瀏覽某內部 project 的 issue，而不必加進 role。Browse Projects 給誰最合適？","zo":["Public","Project lead","Reporter","Application access：Any logged in user"],"fig":"","opts":["Public","Project lead","Reporter","Application access: Any logged in user"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Public 會開放給匿名使用者。","B":"錯。只有一人。","C":"錯。只有提出者。","D":"對。Any logged in user 涵蓋所有有 app 存取的登入使用者。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-project-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.5-e35","sec":"120.1.5","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Customer-reported bugs should be visible only to the Developers role and the person who reported each bug. What should the security level contain?","zh":"客戶回報的 bug 只能讓 Developers role 與該 bug 的回報者看到。Security level 應包含什麼？","zo":["Project role：Developers 與 Reporter","Group：jira-users","只有 Project role：Developers","Public"],"fig":"","opts":["Project role: Developers and Reporter","Group: jira-users","Project role: Developers only","Public"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Role 加 Reporter，兩種人都看得到。","B":"錯。等於所有使用者。","C":"錯。漏了 reporter，回報者建立後就看不到。","D":"錯。等於公開。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/grant-users-access-to-security-levels-in-a-work-item-security-scheme/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.5-e36","sec":"120.1.5","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which steps are required to enable issue-level security in a company-managed project? (Choose two.)","zh":"在 company-managed project 啟用 issue security 需要哪些步驟？（選兩個）","zo":["把 issue security scheme 套到 project","在 permission scheme 把 Set Issue Security 給要設定 level 的人","啟用 issue linking","建立 project category","給 Browse users and groups"],"fig":"","opts":["Associate an issue security scheme with the project","Grant Set Issue Security in the permission scheme to users who will set levels","Enable issue linking","Create a project category","Grant Browse users and groups"],"ans":"AB","why":{"A":"對。要把 scheme 套到 project。","B":"對。要有人有 Set Issue Security 才能設定 level。","C":"錯。與 issue security 無關。","D":"錯。分類無關。","E":"錯。與 issue security 無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-issue-security-schemes/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-work-item-security-schemes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.5-e37","sec":"120.1.5","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A parent issue has the security level 'Confidential'. What is the security level of its sub-tasks?","zh":"Parent issue 的 security level 是「Confidential」。其 sub-task 的 security level 是什麼？","zo":["沒有 level","只能是 project 的 default level","繼承 parent 的「Confidential」","可以是任何 level"],"fig":"","opts":["They have no level","They use the project's default level only","They inherit 'Confidential' from the parent","They can have any level"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。會繼承。","B":"錯。是跟著 parent，不是 default。","C":"對。Sub-task 繼承 parent 的 security level。","D":"錯。不能單獨設定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-issue-security-schemes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.5-e38","sec":"120.1.5","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team-managed project wants certain 'HR case' issues visible only to the HR role. What can the project admin do?","zh":"Team-managed project 想讓某些「HR case」issue 只給 HR role 看。Project admin 能怎麼做？","zo":["把 HR case 這個 issue type 限制為只有 HR role 能存取","建立 issue security scheme","加一個含 Reporter 的 security level","修改 permission scheme"],"fig":"","opts":["Restrict access to the HR case issue type to the HR role","Create an issue security scheme","Add a security level with Reporter","Change the permission scheme"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。TMP 可以限制某個 issue type 只給特定 role 看。","B":"錯。TMP 沒有 issue security scheme。","C":"錯。TMP 沒有 security level。","D":"錯。TMP 沒有 permission scheme。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/set-up-issue-types-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.5-e39","sec":"120.1.5","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user with Set Issue Security can only choose some of the security levels in the dropdown. Why?","zh":"有 Set Issue Security 的使用者，在下拉選單中只能選部分 security level。為什麼？","zo":["使用者只能設定自己是成員的 level","Scheme 的 level 太多","只有 Jira admin 能設定 level","Sub-task 限制了選項"],"fig":"","opts":["Users can only set levels they are members of","The scheme has too many levels","Only Jira admins can set levels","Sub-tasks limit the choices"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。只能選自己是成員的 level。","B":"錯。數量與此無關。","C":"錯。有 Set Issue Security 的人就能設。","D":"錯。題目不是 sub-task。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-issue-security-schemes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.5-e40","sec":"120.1.5","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An issue is moved from a project with an issue security scheme to a project without one. What happens to its visibility?","zh":"Issue 從有 issue security scheme 的 project 移到沒有 scheme 的 project。可見性會怎樣？","zo":["移動被阻擋","新 project 中有 Browse Projects 的人都看得到","保留原本的 security level","所有人都看不到"],"fig":"","opts":["The move is blocked","It becomes visible to anyone with Browse Projects in the new project","It keeps the old security level","It becomes invisible to everyone"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。不會被擋。","B":"對。官方：新 project 沒有 scheme 時，issue 對能存取該 project 的人都可見。","C":"錯。會套用新 project 的設定。","D":"錯。不會變成誰都看不到。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-work-item-security-schemes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.5-e41","sec":"120.1.5","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A support lead wants a single comment on an issue to be visible only to the Developers role, while the rest of the issue stays visible to everyone with access. What should be used?","zh":"Support lead 想讓 issue 上的某一則留言只給 Developers role 看，issue 其他內容仍對有權限的人可見。該用什麼？","zo":["把 issue 設為私人","把留言可見性限制為 Developers role","Issue security level","新的 permission scheme"],"fig":"","opts":["Make the issue private","Comment visibility restricted to the Developers role","An issue security level","A new permission scheme"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。會影響整張 issue。","B":"對。留言可以設定只有某個 role 或 group 看得到。","C":"錯。Security level 限制整張 issue。","D":"錯。不需要改 scheme。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/watch-share-and-comment-on-an-issue/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.1.5-e42","sec":"120.1.5","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which can be added as members of a security level? (Choose two.)","zh":"哪些可以加為 security level 的成員？（選兩個）","zo":["User custom field value","Current assignee","Issue type","Priority","Resolution"],"fig":"","opts":["User custom field value","Current assignee","Issue type","Priority","Resolution"],"ans":"AB","why":{"A":"對。欄位中的使用者可以是成員。","B":"對。目前的 assignee 可以是成員。","C":"錯。不是使用者類型。","D":"錯。不是使用者類型。","E":"錯。不是使用者類型。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/grant-users-access-to-security-levels-in-a-work-item-security-scheme/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.2.1-e01","sec":"120.2.1","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The PMO wants 15 new engineering projects to use identical workflows, screens, and permissions, maintained centrally. What should the Jira admin do?","zh":"PMO 希望 15 個新的工程 project 使用相同的 workflow、screen 與權限，並集中維護。Jira admin 應該怎麼做？","zo":["建立 team-managed project 並手動複製設定","所有團隊共用一個 team-managed project","所有 project 都用 Kanban template","以「Share settings with an existing project」建立 company-managed project"],"fig":"","opts":["Create team-managed projects and copy settings manually","Create one team-managed project for all teams","Use Kanban templates for all projects","Create company-managed projects using 'Share settings with an existing project'"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。TMP 不能共用設定，手動複製難以維持一致。","B":"錯。不符合多個 project 的需求，而且 TMP 只能一個 board。","C":"錯。Template 決定工作方式，不決定設定共用。","D":"對。共用設定讓新 project 直接使用相同的 scheme，維護一份即可。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-new-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.2.1-e02","sec":"120.2.1","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Projects A and B share the same configuration. The Jira admin edits the workflow scheme for project B. What happens?","zh":"Project A 與 B 共用設定。Jira admin 修改了 project B 的 workflow scheme。結果？","zo":["A 與 B 都改變，因為它們共用 scheme","A 改變、B 不變","要重新索引之後才會變","只有 B 改變"],"fig":"","opts":["Both A and B change, because they share the scheme","A changes, B doesn't","Neither changes until re-indexing","Only B changes"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。共用設定的代價：改一次影響所有使用該 scheme 的 project。","B":"錯。不會只改 A。","C":"錯。不需要 re-index。","D":"錯。Scheme 是共用的。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-new-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.2.1-e03","sec":"120.2.1","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A small marketing team wants to start quickly, change its own workflow each week, and doesn't need components or issue security. Which project type fits?","zh":"小型行銷團隊想快速開始、每週自己調整 workflow，也不需要 components 或 issue security。適合哪種 project？","zo":["Service project","Team-managed","共用設定的 company-managed","搭配新 permission scheme 的 company-managed"],"fig":"","opts":["Service project","Team-managed","Company-managed with shared configuration","Company-managed with a new permission scheme"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。不符合需求。","B":"對。TMP 讓團隊自己改設定、快速開始。","C":"錯。共用設定意味著不能自行調整。","D":"錯。CMP 的 workflow 要 Jira admin 改。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.2.1-e04","sec":"120.2.1","dom":"120.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which features are available only in company-managed projects? (Choose two.)","zh":"哪些功能只有 company-managed project 有？（選兩個）","zo":["Issue security schemes","自訂 issue type","Fix versions","Board","Components"],"fig":"","opts":["Issue security schemes","Custom issue types","Fix versions","A board","Components"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。Issue security scheme 只在 CMP。","B":"錯。TMP 也能建自訂 issue type。","C":"錯。TMP 開 Releases 後有 Fix versions。","D":"錯。TMP 也有 board。","E":"對。Components 只在 CMP。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.2.1-e05","sec":"120.2.1","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team works in fixed two-week iterations and wants velocity reporting. Which template should they choose?","zh":"團隊以固定兩週為一個 iteration，並需要 velocity 報表。應選哪個 template？","zo":["Kanban","Bug tracking","Top-level planning","Scrum"],"fig":"","opts":["Kanban","Bug tracking","Top-level planning","Scrum"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Kanban 是連續流，沒有 sprint 與 velocity。","B":"錯。Bug tracking 沒有 sprint 設計。","C":"錯。不是 Jira Software 的一般 project template。","D":"對。Scrum 有 sprint、backlog、velocity。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-the-project-templates/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.2.2-e06","sec":"120.2.2","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project admin of a company-managed project wants to change the project key from MOB to APP. What is true?","zh":"Company-managed project 的 project admin 想把 project key 從 MOB 改成 APP。何者正確？","zo":["Project admin 可以在 Details 頁修改","只有 org、site 或 Jira admin 能改 key","Key 建立後不能改","改 key 需要重建 project"],"fig":"","opts":["The project admin can change it on the Details page","Only an org, site, or Jira admin can change the key","Keys can't be changed after creation","Changing the key requires recreating the project"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Project admin 看到的 key 欄位是停用的。","B":"對。官方：只有 org、site、Jira admin 能改 key。","C":"錯。Key 可以改。","D":"錯。不需要重建。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/edit-a-projects-details/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.2.2-e07","sec":"120.2.2","dom":"120.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"After a project key changes from EXAMPLE to DEMO, which statements are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"Project key 從 EXAMPLE 改成 DEMO 之後，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["新的 project 可以馬上使用 EXAMPLE 這個 key","所有 Confluence 巨集永久失效","指向 EXAMPLE-1 的連結仍會導向 DEMO-1","Description 裡寫的文字「EXAMPLE-1」不會被更新","使用舊 key 的 filter 失效"],"fig":"","opts":["A new project can immediately use the key EXAMPLE","All Confluence macros break permanently","Links to EXAMPLE-1 still direct to DEMO-1","The text 'EXAMPLE-1' written in descriptions isn't updated","Filters using the old key stop working"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。Previous key 不能被新 project 使用。","B":"錯。巨集繼續運作，可能要等快取更新。","C":"對。舊 key 被保留，舊連結仍會導向。","D":"對。官方：description 中的文字別名不會更新（連結仍可導向）。","E":"錯。舊 key 仍可在 filter 與 JQL 中運作。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/edit-a-projects-details/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.2.2-e08","sec":"120.2.2","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The project lead is Sara. The project admin wants new issues to be assigned to Tom by default when there are no components. What can they do?","zh":"Project lead 是 Sara。Project admin 希望沒有 component 時，新 issue 預設指派給 Tom。可以怎麼做？","zo":["給 Tom Browse users and groups","在 Details 頁把 default assignee 設成 Tom","把 project lead 改成 Tom，default assignee 設為 Project lead","把 Tom 加進 Administrators role"],"fig":"","opts":["Give Tom Browse users and groups","Set the default assignee to Tom on the Details page","Change the project lead to Tom and set default assignee to Project lead","Add Tom to the Administrators role"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。與指派無關。","B":"錯。Default assignee 只能 Unassigned 或 project lead。","C":"對。把 project lead 換成 Tom，default assignee 設 Project lead。","D":"錯。Role 不影響指派。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-projects-details/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.2.2-e09","sec":"120.2.2","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project admin renames the project 'Mobile' to 'Mobile Apps'. What happens to existing filters that reference the project?","zh":"Project admin 把 project「Mobile」改名為「Mobile Apps」。既有引用這個 project 的 filter 會怎樣？","zo":["被刪除","永遠顯示舊名稱","失效，必須手動修改","自動更新為新名稱"],"fig":"","opts":["They are deleted","They keep showing the old name forever","They break and must be edited","They are updated automatically with the new name"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。不會刪除。","B":"錯。會更新。","C":"錯。不會失效。","D":"對。官方：改名後所有 filter 會自動更新。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.2.3-e10","sec":"120.2.3","dom":"120.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A release manager releases version 3.0, but four issues are still unresolved. What options does Jira offer? (Choose two.)","zh":"Release manager 發布 3.0 版時還有四個未解決的 issue。Jira 提供哪些選項？（選兩個）","zo":["Jira 刪除未解決的 issue","把未解決的 issue 移到另一個 version","忽略並照樣發布","Jira 阻擋發布直到全部解決","Jira 自動把它們設為已解決"],"fig":"","opts":["Jira deletes the unresolved issues","Move the unresolved issues to another version","Ignore them and release anyway","Jira blocks the release until all are resolved","Jira automatically resolves them"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。不會刪除 issue。","B":"對。可以把未解決的 issue 移到另一個 version。","C":"對。也可以忽略並照樣發布。","D":"錯。不會被擋。","E":"錯。不會自動解決。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/release-your-teams-work-in-versions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.2.3-e11","sec":"120.2.3","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Versions 2.1 and 2.2 are merged into 2.3. What happens?","zh":"把 2.1 與 2.2 合併到 2.3。會發生什麼？","zo":["2.3 被改名為 2.1-2.3","2.1 與 2.2 的 issue 改為 2.3，且 2.1、2.2 被刪除","2.1、2.2 保留並指向 2.3","Issue 失去 fix version"],"fig":"","opts":["2.3 is renamed to 2.1-2.3","Issues from 2.1 and 2.2 now have 2.3, and versions 2.1 and 2.2 are deleted","2.1 and 2.2 remain and point to 2.3","Issues lose their fix version"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。不會改名。","B":"對。合併後 issue 改指到目標 version，來源 version 被刪除。","C":"錯。來源 version 不會保留。","D":"錯。Issue 會改指到 2.3。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/release-your-teams-work-in-versions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.2.3-e12","sec":"120.2.3","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project admin tries to create a second version named '1.0' in the same project. What happens?","zh":"Project admin 想在同一 project 建立第二個名為「1.0」的 version。結果？","zo":["被拒絕，因為 version 名稱在 project 內必須唯一","取代舊的 1.0","在別的 project 建立","加上後綴後建立"],"fig":"","opts":["It's rejected because version names must be unique in the project","It replaces the old 1.0","It's created in a different project","It's created with a suffix"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Version 名稱在 project 內唯一。","B":"錯。不會取代。","C":"錯。不會跑到別的 project。","D":"錯。不會自動加後綴。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-is-a-version/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.2.3-e13","sec":"120.2.3","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin deletes version 1.5, which is set as the Fix version on 20 issues. What must they decide?","zh":"Admin 刪除 version 1.5，有 20 張 issue 的 Fix version 是它。必須決定什麼？","zo":["把這些 issue 的 fix version 改到另一個 version，或直接移除","不用決定，issue 會一起被刪除","是否封存 project","這些 issue 要進哪個 sprint"],"fig":"","opts":["Whether to move those issues' fix version to another version or remove it","Nothing; the issues are deleted too","Whether to archive the project","Which sprint the issues go to"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。刪除 version 時要決定 Fix／Affects version 改指到哪個 version，或直接移除。","B":"錯。Issue 不會被刪除。","C":"錯。與 project 封存無關。","D":"錯。Sprint 與 version 是不同概念。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/release-your-teams-work-in-versions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.2.4-e14","sec":"120.2.4","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An issue has components Hardware (default assignee: Component lead, Lee) and Software (default assignee: Project default). Assignee is set to Automatic. Who is assigned?","zh":"Issue 有 Hardware（default assignee：Component lead，Lee）與 Software（default assignee：Project default）兩個 component，Assignee 選 Automatic。指派給誰？","zo":["Lee","Project lead","Unassigned","Reporter"],"fig":"","opts":["Lee","The project lead","Unassigned","The reporter"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Component lead 類型最高，指派給 Lee（Lee 要有 Assignable User）。","B":"錯。Project default 類型最低。","C":"錯。不會因衝突變 Unassigned。","D":"錯。Reporter 不在規則中。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/manage-components-default-assignee-jira-software/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.2.4-e15","sec":"120.2.4","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An issue has components Blockchain (Unassigned) and Analytics (Project default, where the project default is the project lead Amanda). Who is assigned?","zh":"Issue 有 Blockchain（Unassigned）與 Analytics（Project default，而 project default 是 project lead Amanda）兩個 component。指派給誰？","zo":["Analytics 的 component lead","Reporter","Amanda","Unassigned"],"fig":"","opts":["The Analytics component lead","The reporter","Amanda","Unassigned"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Analytics 設的是 Project default，不是 component lead。","B":"錯。Reporter 不在規則中。","C":"錯。Project default 在類型中最低，不會先被展開成 Amanda 再比。","D":"對。Unassigned 高於 Project default，所以結果是 Unassigned。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/manage-components-default-assignee-jira-software/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.2.4-e16","sec":"120.2.4","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A component lead is set as the default assignee, but new issues with that component are never assigned to them. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Component 的 default assignee 設為 component lead，但帶此 component 的新 issue 從未指派給他。最可能的原因？","zo":["Component lead 缺少 Assignable User 權限","Components 只能用在 team-managed project","要 project lead 核准","Component 名稱太長"],"fig":"","opts":["The component lead lacks the Assignable User permission","Components only work in team-managed projects","The project lead must approve it","The component name is too long"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。沒有 Assignable User 的人會被跳過。","B":"錯。Components 只在 CMP。","C":"錯。沒有核准機制。","D":"錯。名稱與指派無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/manage-components-default-assignee-jira-software/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.2.4-e17","sec":"120.2.4","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An issue has no components and Assignee is set to Automatic. Who is assigned?","zh":"Issue 沒有 component，Assignee 選 Automatic。指派給誰？","zo":["字母序第一個 component lead","一律 Unassigned","最後編輯 project 的人","Project 的 default assignee"],"fig":"","opts":["The first component lead alphabetically","Always Unassigned","The last person who edited the project","The project's default assignee"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。沒有 component。","B":"錯。看 project default 設定。","C":"錯。不在規則中。","D":"對。沒有帶 default assignee 的 component 時，用 project 的 default assignee。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/who-does-the-automatic-assignee-option-assign-an-issue-to/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.3.1-e01","sec":"120.3.1","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira admin renames the issue type 'Defect' to 'Bug'. Which projects are affected?","zh":"Jira admin 把 issue type「Defect」改名為「Bug」。哪些 project 受影響？","zo":["只有 admin 當下在操作的 project","所有 issue type scheme 含有這個 issue type 的 project","只有 team-managed project","要等 scheme 重新發布才會受影響"],"fig":"","opts":["Only the project where the admin was working","All projects whose issue type schemes include that issue type","Only team-managed projects","None until the scheme is republished"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Issue type 是全站物件，不屬於單一 project。","B":"對。改名會出現在所有使用這個 issue type 的 project。","C":"錯。TMP 的 issue type 各自獨立，這裡改的是全站 issue type。","D":"錯。不需要重新發布。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-edit-and-delete-an-issue-type/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.3.1-e02","sec":"120.3.1","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A new issue type 'Change Request' was created, but it doesn't appear in the Operations project. What should the admin do?","zh":"新建了 issue type「Change Request」，但它沒有出現在 Operations project。Admin 應該怎麼做？","zo":["重新索引站台","把它加進 Operations project 使用的 issue type scheme","把它加進 workflow scheme","把它加進 permission scheme"],"fig":"","opts":["Re-index the site","Add it to the issue type scheme used by the Operations project","Add it to the workflow scheme","Add it to the permission scheme"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。不是索引問題。","B":"對。Project 能用哪些 issue type 由 issue type scheme 決定。","C":"錯。Workflow scheme 決定 workflow，不決定有哪些 type。","D":"錯。權限無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-issue-type-schemes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.3.1-e03","sec":"120.3.1","dom":"120.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"In a company-managed project, which schemes map issue types to configuration? (Choose two.)","zh":"在 company-managed project，哪些 scheme 會依 issue type 對應設定？（選兩個）","zo":["Notification scheme 把 issue type 對應到 screen","Issue security scheme 把 issue type 對應到 workflow","Workflow scheme 把 issue type 對應到 workflow","Field configuration scheme 把 issue type 對應到 field configuration","Permission scheme 把 issue type 對應到權限"],"fig":"","opts":["Notification scheme maps issue types to screens","Issue security scheme maps issue types to workflows","Workflow scheme maps issue types to workflows","Field configuration scheme maps issue types to field configurations","Permission scheme maps issue types to permissions"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。Notification scheme 對應事件與收件人。","B":"錯。Issue security 與 workflow 無關。","C":"對。Workflow scheme 依 issue type 指定 workflow。","D":"對。Field configuration scheme 依 issue type 指定欄位行為。","E":"錯。Permission scheme 不依 issue type。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-issue-types/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.3.1-e04","sec":"120.3.1","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A parent task has an original estimate of 4h and two sub-tasks with 2h each. With 'Include sub-tasks' selected, what does the parent's time tracking show as original estimate?","zh":"Parent task 的 original estimate 是 4h，兩個 sub-task 各 2h。勾選「Include sub-tasks」時，parent 的 time tracking 顯示的 original estimate 是？","zo":["2h","6h","4h","8h"],"fig":"","opts":["2h","6h","4h","8h"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。只是一個 sub-task。","B":"錯。少算了一個 sub-task。","C":"錯。那是 parent 自己的估計。","D":"對。勾 Include sub-tasks 時，parent 顯示自己＋所有 sub-task 的總和：4＋2＋2＝8h。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-estimation-and-tracking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.3.1-e05","sec":"120.3.1","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira admin wants to disable sub-tasks site-wide, but existing sub-tasks exist. What must be done first?","zh":"Jira admin 想全站停用 sub-task，但目前已有 sub-task。必須先做什麼？","zo":["把既有 sub-task 轉成 standard issue type","刪除所有 parent issue","從 permission scheme 移除 sub-task","什麼都不用，停用會自動刪除它們"],"fig":"","opts":["Convert existing sub-tasks to standard issue types","Delete all parent issues","Remove sub-tasks from the permission scheme","Nothing; disabling deletes them automatically"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。有 sub-task 存在時，要先轉成 standard issue type 才能停用。","B":"錯。不需要刪除 parent。","C":"錯。與權限無關。","D":"錯。不會自動刪除。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-sub-tasks/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.3.1-e06","sec":"120.3.1","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A company-managed epic in the PLATFORM project needs child stories from the WEB and MOBILE projects. What is true?","zh":"PLATFORM project 中的 company-managed epic 需要 WEB 與 MOBILE project 的 story 當 child。何者正確？","zo":["跨 project 的 child 需要 team-managed project","Child 必須是 sub-task","Company-managed epic 可以有其他 project 的 child issue","Epic 只能包含同 project 的 issue"],"fig":"","opts":["Cross-project children require team-managed projects","Children must be sub-tasks","Company-managed epics can have child issues from other projects","Epics can only contain issues from the same project"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。是 CMP 的能力。","B":"錯。Epic 的 child 是 standard issue。","C":"對。CMP 支援 cross-project epic。","D":"錯。CMP 的 epic 可跨 project。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-issue-types/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.3.1-e07","sec":"120.3.1","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The 'Bug' issue type must be removed from a project's issue type scheme, but the project already has 120 bugs. What happens?","zh":"要把「Bug」issue type 從某 project 的 issue type scheme 移除，但該 project 已有 120 張 bug。會怎樣？","zo":["這些 bug 保留被移除的 type","無法移除","這些 bug 被刪除","Admin 必須把這些 issue migrate 到其他 issue type"],"fig":"","opts":["The bugs keep the removed type","Removal is impossible","The bugs are deleted","The admin must migrate those issues to another issue type"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。不會保留不在 scheme 中的 type。","B":"錯。可以，只是要先 migrate。","C":"錯。不會刪除 issue。","D":"對。移除使用中的 issue type 前要把既有 issue migrate 到其他 type。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-edit-and-delete-an-issue-type-scheme/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.3.1-e08","sec":"120.3.1","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Who can create a new issue type in a team-managed project?","zh":"誰能在 team-managed project 建立新的 issue type？","zo":["任何 member","該 project 的 project admin","只有 Jira admin","只有 org admin"],"fig":"","opts":["Any member","A project admin of that project","Only a Jira admin","Only an org admin"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Member 不能改設定。","B":"對。TMP 的 project admin 在 Project settings → Issue types 直接建立。","C":"錯。TMP 不需要 Jira admin。","D":"錯。不需要 org admin。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/set-up-issue-types-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.3.1-e09","sec":"120.3.1","dom":"120.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements about issue type schemes are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"關於 issue type scheme，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["控制誰看得到每種 issue type","每個 project 可同時使用多個 issue type scheme","定義 project 可以使用哪些 issue type","可以設定預設 issue type","定義每個 issue type 的 workflow"],"fig":"","opts":["They control who can see each issue type","Each project can use several issue type schemes at once","They define which issue types a project can use","They can set a default issue type","They define workflows for each issue type"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。不控制可見性。","B":"錯。一個 project 只用一個 issue type scheme。","C":"對。決定 project 可用的 issue type。","D":"對。可設預設 issue type 與排序。","E":"錯。那是 workflow scheme。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-issue-type-schemes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.3.2-e10","sec":"120.3.2","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The 'Severity' select field needs options S1–S4 in project A and Low/High in project B. What is the best approach?","zh":"「Severity」下拉欄位在 project A 要 S1–S4、在 project B 要 Low／High。最好的做法？","zo":["用兩個 screen","替這個欄位建兩個 context，各自設定 project 與選項","建兩個都叫 Severity 的欄位","用兩個 field configuration"],"fig":"","opts":["Use two screens","Create two contexts for the field, each with its own options and projects","Create two separate fields named Severity","Use two field configurations"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Screen 只決定顯示與否。","B":"對。每個 context 可設自己的 project 範圍與選項。","C":"錯。兩個同名欄位會造成 JQL 與報表混亂。","D":"錯。Field configuration 管 required／hide，不管選項。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-a-context-to-a-custom-field/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.3.2-e11","sec":"120.3.2","dom":"120.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A custom field is on the screen, but users can't see it on Bug issues in project X. Which could be the cause? (Choose two.)","zh":"某 custom field 已在 screen 上，但使用者在 project X 的 Bug issue 看不到它。可能原因？（選兩個）","zo":["欄位的 renderer 是 wiki style","欄位的 context 不包含 Bug 或 project X","Bug 的 field configuration 隱藏了這個欄位","使用者缺少 Browse users and groups","停用了 issue linking"],"fig":"","opts":["The field's renderer is wiki style","The field's context doesn't include Bug or project X","The field configuration for Bug hides the field","The users lack Browse users and groups","Issue linking is disabled"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。Renderer 只影響格式。","B":"對。Context 不含該 project 或 issue type，欄位就不存在。","C":"對。Field configuration 設 Hide 時，即使在 screen 上也看不到。","D":"錯。與欄位顯示無關。","E":"錯。無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-a-context-to-a-custom-field/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/change-a-field-configuration/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.3.2-e12","sec":"120.3.2","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Story Points must be required on Stories and hidden on Bugs in the same project. How should this be configured?","zh":"同一個 project 中，Story Points 在 Story 必填、在 Bug 隱藏。該怎麼設定？","zo":["在 Bug 加 workflow validator","兩個 field configuration，透過 field configuration scheme 依 issue type 對應","Story Points 建兩個 context","兩個 permission scheme"],"fig":"","opts":["A workflow validator on Bugs","Two field configurations associated with issue types through a field configuration scheme","Two contexts for Story Points","Two permission schemes"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Validator 只在 transition 時檢查，無法隱藏欄位。","B":"對。Field configuration 管 required／hide，field configuration scheme 依 issue type 套用。","C":"錯。Context 決定欄位存在與預設值、選項，不控制 required。","D":"錯。權限無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/associate-field-behavior-with-an-issue-type/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.3.2-e13","sec":"120.3.2","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Users want to use bold, lists, and tables in a custom paragraph field, but it shows plain text. What should be changed?","zh":"使用者想在自訂段落欄位使用粗體、清單與表格，但只能顯示純文字。應該修改什麼？","zo":["給 Edit Issues 權限","在 field configuration 把欄位的 renderer 改成 Wiki style renderer","修改欄位的 context","把欄位加到 View screen"],"fig":"","opts":["Grant Edit Issues","Set the field's renderer to Wiki style renderer in the field configuration","Change the field's context","Add the field to the View screen"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。不是權限問題。","B":"對。Renderer 決定是否可格式化。","C":"錯。Context 不影響格式。","D":"錯。已經看得到，只是不能格式化。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/change-a-field-configuration/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.3.2-e14","sec":"120.3.2","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira admin deletes a custom field by mistake. What can be done?","zh":"Jira admin 誤刪了一個 custom field。能怎麼做？","zo":["從 project trash 還原","在 60 天內從 Deleted fields 分頁還原","沒辦法，刪除是立即且永久的","重建同名欄位，資料會自動回來"],"fig":"","opts":["Restore it from the project trash","Restore it from the Deleted fields tab within 60 days","Nothing; deletion is immediate and permanent","Recreate it and the data returns automatically"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。不是 project trash。","B":"對。官方：欄位會被標記 60 天後刪除，期間可在 Deleted fields 還原，資料一起回來。","C":"錯。不是立即永久刪除。","D":"錯。重建的是新欄位，舊資料不會自動回來。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/specify-field-behavior/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.3.2-e15","sec":"120.3.2","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In a team-managed project, a project admin creates a 'Vendor' field. Which is true?","zh":"Team-managed project 的 project admin 建立了「Vendor」欄位。何者正確？","zo":["需要 field configuration scheme","這個欄位只存在於該 project","這個欄位變成全站可用","需要 Jira admin 核准"],"fig":"","opts":["It requires a field configuration scheme","The field exists only in that project","The field becomes available site-wide","A Jira admin must approve it"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。TMP 沒有 field configuration scheme。","B":"對。TMP 建立的欄位只屬於這個 project。","C":"錯。不會變全站欄位。","D":"錯。不需要核准。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/available-custom-fields-for-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.3.2-e16","sec":"120.3.2","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What happens if the same project is added to two different contexts of one custom field?","zh":"如果把同一個 project 加到同一個 custom field 的兩個 context，會怎樣？","zo":["不允許；一個 project 只能屬於某欄位的一個 context","兩個 context 都生效、選項合併","最新的 context 勝出","Global context 勝出"],"fig":"","opts":["It isn't allowed; a project can belong to only one context of a field","Both contexts apply and options are merged","The newest context wins","The global context wins"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。同一個欄位，一個 project 只能屬於一個 context。","B":"錯。不會合併。","C":"錯。根本不能這樣設定。","D":"錯。不能重複指定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-a-context-to-a-custom-field/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.3.2-e17","sec":"120.3.2","dom":"120.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which are configured in a field configuration? (Choose two.)","zh":"哪些在 field configuration 中設定？（選兩個）","zo":["欄位是否隱藏","欄位適用哪些 project","欄位的下拉選項","每個 project 的欄位預設值","欄位是否必填"],"fig":"","opts":["Whether a field is hidden","Which projects the field applies to","The field's select options","The field's default value per project","Whether a field is required"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。Hide。","B":"錯。那是 context。","C":"錯。選項在 context。","D":"錯。預設值在 context。","E":"對。Required。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/change-a-field-configuration/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.3.3-e18","sec":"120.3.3","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Bugs should show an 'Environment' field when created, but not on other issue types' create screens. What should the Jira admin configure?","zh":"Bug 建立時要顯示「Environment」欄位，其他 issue type 的建立畫面不顯示。Jira admin 應設定什麼？","zo":["給 Bug 一個 screen scheme，其 Create 操作使用含 Environment 的 screen，並在 issue type screen scheme 中對應","對 Bug 用隱藏 Environment 的 field configuration","新的 permission scheme","只改 issue layout"],"fig":"","opts":["A screen scheme for Bug whose Create operation uses a screen with Environment, mapped in the issue type screen scheme","A field configuration hiding Environment for Bug","A new permission scheme","The issue layout only"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。依 issue type 給 Bug 專屬的 screen scheme，Create 操作用含 Environment 的 screen。","B":"錯。這會隱藏，與需求相反。","C":"錯。權限無關。","D":"錯。Layout 只排列 view，不決定 create 畫面。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-issue-screens/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.3.3-e19","sec":"120.3.3","dom":"120.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which operations can a screen scheme map to different screens? (Choose two.)","zh":"Screen scheme 可以把哪些操作對應到不同 screen？（選兩個）","zo":["Assign issue","Delete issue","Link issue","Create issue","Edit issue"],"fig":"","opts":["Assign issue","Delete issue","Link issue","Create issue","Edit issue"],"ans":"DE","why":{"A":"錯。不是 screen scheme 操作。","B":"錯。不是。","C":"錯。不是。","D":"對。Create 是 screen scheme 的操作之一。","E":"對。Edit 也是。（另一個是 View。）"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-issue-screens/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.3.3-e20","sec":"120.3.3","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project admin wants to move the Priority field to the top of the issue's details panel. Where is this done?","zh":"Project admin 想把 Priority 欄位移到 issue 詳細資料區的最上方。在哪裡做？","zo":["Settings > Screens","Field configuration","Permission scheme","Project settings > Issue layout"],"fig":"","opts":["Settings > Screens","Field configuration","Permission scheme","Project settings > Issue layout"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Screen 要 Jira admin，且決定有哪些欄位，不是位置。","B":"錯。Field configuration 管行為。","C":"錯。權限無關。","D":"對。Project admin 用 issue layout 排列欄位位置。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-field-layout-in-the-issue-view/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.3.3-e21","sec":"120.3.3","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In the issue layout, a field is placed below the 'Hide when empty' line. What happens?","zh":"在 issue layout 中，某欄位被放在「Hide when empty」線以下。會怎樣？","zo":["永遠不顯示","永遠顯示在 Details","從 screen 移除","沒值時在 More fields，有值時移到 Details"],"fig":"","opts":["It's never shown","It's always shown in Details","It's removed from the screen","It appears under More fields when empty and moves to Details when it has a value"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。有值就會顯示。","B":"錯。沒值時不在 Details。","C":"錯。不會從 screen 移除。","D":"對。沒值時收在 More fields，有值時移到 Details。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-field-layout-in-the-issue-view/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.3.3-e22","sec":"120.3.3","dom":"120.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A Jira admin copies project A's issue layout to project B, which uses the same screen. Which statements are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Jira admin 把 project A 的 issue layout 複製到使用相同 screen 的 project B。哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["不論 screen 為何都能複製","Project B 原本的 layout 被覆蓋","之後修改 A 不會影響 B","兩個 layout 保持連動","欄位的值也會被複製"],"fig":"","opts":["Any project can receive it regardless of screen","Project B's existing layout is overridden","Later changes to A don't affect B","The two layouts stay linked","Field values are copied too"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。只能複製到使用相同 screen 的 project。","B":"對。官方：複製會覆蓋目標 project 的 layout。","C":"對。不建立連結，之後各自獨立。","D":"錯。不會連動。","E":"錯。只複製版面，不複製欄位內容。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/copy-an-issue-layout-to-other-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.3.3-e23","sec":"120.3.3","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project admin wants to add a brand-new field to the issue view, but it isn't in the list of available fields in the layout. Why?","zh":"Project admin 想把一個新欄位加到 issue view，但 layout 的可用欄位清單中沒有它。為什麼？","zo":["必須先把欄位隱藏","Layout 只顯示系統欄位","該欄位不在 view screen 上；要由 Jira admin 加到 screen","Project admin 不能使用 layout"],"fig":"","opts":["The field must be hidden first","Layouts only show system fields","The field isn't on the view screen; a Jira admin must add it to the screen","Project admins can't use layouts"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。不需要先隱藏。","B":"錯。也包含 custom field。","C":"對。Layout 只能排列 view screen 上已有的欄位；加欄位要 Jira admin 改 screen。","D":"錯。Project admin 可以用 layout。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-field-layout-in-the-issue-view/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.3.3-e24","sec":"120.3.3","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"How are a project's screens associated with its issue types in a company-managed project?","zh":"在 company-managed project，screen 如何與 issue type 關聯？","zo":["Workflow scheme → screen scheme","Issue type screen scheme → screen scheme → screen","Screen → issue type → project","Permission scheme → screen"],"fig":"","opts":["Workflow scheme → screen scheme","Issue type screen scheme → screen scheme → screen","Screen → issue type → project","Permission scheme → screen"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Workflow scheme 指定 workflow；transition screen 是另外掛在 workflow 上。","B":"對。Issue type screen scheme 依 issue type 指定 screen scheme，screen scheme 依操作指定 screen。","C":"錯。方向與層級不對。","D":"錯。權限無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-issue-screens/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.3.3-e25","sec":"120.3.3","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In a team-managed project, how are fields configured for each issue type?","zh":"在 team-managed project，每個 issue type 的欄位怎麼設定？","zo":["Jira admin 編輯 screen scheme","透過 field configuration scheme","透過 permission scheme","Project admin 在 Project settings 把欄位拖拉到 issue type"],"fig":"","opts":["Jira admin edits screen schemes","Through field configuration schemes","Through the permission scheme","Project admin drags fields into the issue type in Project settings"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。TMP 沒有 screen scheme。","B":"錯。TMP 沒有 field configuration scheme。","C":"錯。權限無關。","D":"對。TMP 在 Project settings → Issue types 拖拉欄位。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-an-issues-fields-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.3.3-e26","sec":"120.3.3","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A transition 'Resolve' should prompt users to choose a resolution. What should be configured?","zh":"「Resolve」transition 執行時要讓使用者選 resolution。應設定什麼？","zo":["Field context","Issue type scheme","在 Resolve transition 掛一個含 Resolution 欄位的 transition screen","Issue layout"],"fig":"","opts":["A field context","The issue type scheme","A transition screen containing the Resolution field on the Resolve transition","The issue layout"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Context 不會讓欄位在轉換時跳出。","B":"錯。無關。","C":"對。在 transition 掛 screen，轉換時就會跳出填寫。","D":"錯。Layout 只排列 view。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-issue-screens/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.3.2-e27","sec":"120.3.2","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A new custom field 'Customer tier' was created with the default global context and added to screens. Where will it be available?","zh":"新建的 custom field「Customer tier」使用預設的 global context，並已加到 screen。它會在哪裡可用？","zo":["只在建立它的 project","只在 team-managed project","要先建 field configuration scheme 才能用","所有 project、所有 issue type 中 screen 有包含它的地方"],"fig":"","opts":["Only in the project where it was created","Only in team-managed projects","Nowhere until a field configuration scheme is created","In all projects and all issue types whose screens include it"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Custom field 是全站物件，不屬於某個 project。","B":"錯。TMP 自建的欄位才只在單一 project；這是全站 custom field。","C":"錯。不需要新的 field configuration scheme 就能使用。","D":"對。預設 global context 套用到所有 project 與 issue type；再由 screen 決定是否顯示。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-a-context-to-a-custom-field/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.4.1-e01","sec":"120.4.1","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Only members of the QA project role should see the 'Close' transition button. What should be added to the transition?","zh":"只有 QA project role 的成員能看到「Close」transition 按鈕。Transition 應加什麼？","zo":["Validator：Field Required","Post function：Assign to reporter","Done status 上的 workflow property","Condition：User Is In Project Role（QA）"],"fig":"","opts":["A validator: Field Required","A post function: Assign to reporter","A workflow property on the Done status","A condition: User Is In Project Role (QA)"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Validator 在提交時檢查，不會藏按鈕。","B":"錯。Post function 在轉換後執行。","C":"錯。Property 不是用來限制 role 的標準做法。","D":"對。Condition 決定按鈕是否出現。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-advanced-issue-workflows/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.4.1-e02","sec":"120.4.1","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Issues reopened from Done to In Progress don't appear in filters using 'resolution = Unresolved'. What should be fixed?","zh":"從 Done 重新打開到 In Progress 的 issue，沒有出現在「resolution = Unresolved」的 filter 中。該修正什麼？","zo":["把 In Progress status 改名","把 Resolution 欄位加到 create screen","修改 board 欄位","在 reopen transition 加 post function 清空 Resolution 欄位"],"fig":"","opts":["Rename the In Progress status","Add the Resolution field to the create screen","Change the board columns","Add a post function on the reopen transition to clear the Resolution field"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Status 名稱不影響 resolution。","B":"錯。放在 create screen 會讓 issue 一建立就被視為已解決。","C":"錯。Board 欄位與 filter 結果無關。","D":"對。Reopen 時要用 post function 把 resolution 設為 None。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-advanced-issue-workflows/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.4.1-e03","sec":"120.4.1","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A new status 'In QA' was added to the workflow, and issues moved to it disappear from the Scrum board. Why?","zh":"Workflow 新增了「In QA」status，issue 移到這個 status 後就從 Scrum board 消失。為什麼？","zo":["這個 status 沒有對應到 board 欄位","這個 status 沒有 category","Workflow 沒有被複製","新 status 的 issue 會隱藏 24 小時"],"fig":"","opts":["The status isn't mapped to a board column","The status has no category","The workflow wasn't copied","Issues in new statuses are hidden for 24 hours"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Board 只顯示已對應到欄位的 status。","B":"錯。每個 status 都有 category。","C":"錯。與複製無關。","D":"錯。沒有這種機制。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.4.1-e04","sec":"120.4.1","dom":"120.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"When an issue is transitioned to 'Escalated', the operations manager must receive a specific email that no other event sends. Which configuration is needed? (Choose two.)","zh":"Issue 轉到「Escalated」時，營運經理要收到一封其他 event 不會寄的特定 email。需要哪些設定？（選兩個）","zo":["加 jira.issue.editable property","建立新的 screen","建立 custom event，並在 transition 的 post function 觸發它","在 notification scheme 為該 custom event 設定經理為收件人","在 transition 加 validator"],"fig":"","opts":["Add a property jira.issue.editable","Create a new screen","Create a custom event and fire it in the transition's post function","Add the custom event to the notification scheme with the manager as recipient","Add a validator to the transition"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。Property 與通知無關。","B":"錯。Screen 與通知無關。","C":"對。建立 custom event，在 transition 的 post function 觸發。","D":"對。Notification scheme 中為該 event 設定收件人。","E":"錯。Validator 是檢查用。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-a-custom-event/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.4.1-e05","sec":"120.4.1","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Issues in the 'Approved' status must not be editable. What should be configured?","zh":"處於「Approved」status 的 issue 不能被編輯。應該設定什麼？","zo":["在轉入 Approved 的 transition 加 condition","從 permission scheme 移除 Edit Issues","在 field configuration 隱藏所有欄位","在 Approved status 加 jira.issue.editable = false property"],"fig":"","opts":["Add a condition to the transition into Approved","Remove Edit Issues from the permission scheme","Hide all fields in the field configuration","Add the property jira.issue.editable = false to the Approved status"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Condition 控制能否轉入，不控制轉入後能否編輯。","B":"錯。會讓所有 status 都不能編輯。","C":"錯。隱藏欄位會連看都看不到。","D":"對。這個 workflow property 讓該 status 的 issue 不可編輯。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-workflow-properties/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.4.1-e06","sec":"120.4.1","dom":"120.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which are ways to set the Resolution field when resolving issues? (Choose two.)","zh":"解決 issue 時，可以用哪些方式設定 Resolution 欄位？（選兩個）","zo":["含 Resolution 欄位的 transition screen","更新 Resolution 欄位的 post function","把 Resolution 加到 issue create screen","把 Done status 改名為 Resolved","把 issue 移到 board 最後一欄"],"fig":"","opts":["A transition screen containing the Resolution field","A post function that updates the Resolution field","Adding Resolution to the issue create screen","Renaming the Done status to Resolved","Moving the issue to the last board column"],"ans":"AB","why":{"A":"對。轉換時讓使用者選。","B":"對。Post function 自動設值。","C":"錯。會讓 issue 一建立就被視為已解決。","D":"錯。Status 名稱與 resolution 無關。","E":"錯。CMP board 欄位不會設 resolution（TMP 的 Done 欄才會）。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-advanced-issue-workflows/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.4.1-e07","sec":"120.4.1","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user clicks a transition, fills the screen, and gets an error that 'Fix versions' is required. Which workflow component produced this?","zh":"使用者點了 transition、填完 screen 後，出現「Fix versions 必填」的錯誤。這是哪個 workflow 元件造成的？","zo":["Condition","Post function","Workflow property","Validator"],"fig":"","opts":["A condition","A post function","A workflow property","A validator"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Condition 不符時按鈕根本不會出現。","B":"錯。Post function 不檢查輸入。","C":"錯。Property 不會產生這種錯誤訊息。","D":"對。Validator 在提交時檢查輸入，不符就報錯。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-workflow-validators-for-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.4.2-e08","sec":"120.4.2","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In a team-managed project, Bugs need a different workflow than Tasks. What is true?","zh":"在 team-managed project，Bug 需要與 Task 不同的 workflow。何者正確？","zo":["所有 issue type 共用一個 workflow","要由 Jira admin 建立 workflow scheme","Team-managed project 沒有 workflow","每個 issue type 都能有自己的 workflow，由 project admin 編輯"],"fig":"","opts":["All issue types share one workflow","A Jira admin must create a workflow scheme","Team-managed projects don't have workflows","Each issue type can have its own workflow, edited by the project admin"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。不必共用。","B":"錯。TMP 沒有 workflow scheme。","C":"錯。當然有 workflow。","D":"對。TMP 可為每個 issue type 設定各自的 workflow。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-how-work-flows-in-your-team-managed-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.4.2-e09","sec":"120.4.2","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Only the QA role should be able to move issues out of 'In review' in a team-managed project. Which rule should be added?","zh":"在 team-managed project，只有 QA role 能把 issue 移出「In review」。應該加哪個 rule？","zo":["Copy the value of one field to another","Restrict to when a work item is a specific value","Restrict who can move a work item（role：QA）","Assign a work item to someone"],"fig":"","opts":["Copy the value of one field to another","Restrict to when a work item is a specific value","Restrict who can move a work item (role: QA)","Assign a work item to someone"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。這是複製欄位。","B":"錯。這是依欄位值限制，不是依人。","C":"對。限制誰能移動，可指定 role。","D":"錯。這是自動指派。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/available-workflow-rules-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.4.2-e10","sec":"120.4.2","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Work must go through 'In review' immediately before 'Done' in a team-managed project. Which rule fits?","zh":"在 team-managed project，工作必須在 Done 之前剛好經過「In review」。適合哪個 rule？","zo":["Assign a work item to someone","Update a work item field","Validate that people have a specific permission","Restrict to when a work item has been through a status，並勾「Only consider the most recent status」"],"fig":"","opts":["Assign a work item to someone","Update a work item field","Validate that people have a specific permission","Restrict to when a work item has been through a status, with 'Only consider the most recent status'"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。指派不會限制流程。","B":"錯。更新欄位不會限制流程。","C":"錯。檢查權限，不是流程順序。","D":"對。官方範例：檢查最近的 status 是 In review。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/available-workflow-rules-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.4.2-e11","sec":"120.4.2","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project admin renames the status 'Doing' to 'In progress' in a team-managed project. What is affected?","zh":"Project admin 在 team-managed project 把 status「Doing」改名為「In progress」。影響範圍？","zo":["只有這個 team-managed project","站上所有 project","所有 team-managed project","只影響 board、不影響 workflow"],"fig":"","opts":["Only that team-managed project","All projects on the site","All team-managed projects","Only the board, not the workflow"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。TMP 的 status 屬於該 project。","B":"錯。不是全站物件。","C":"錯。各 TMP 獨立。","D":"錯。Board 欄位與 status 連動。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-edit-and-delete-statuses-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.4.2-e12","sec":"120.4.2","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"When an issue moves to 'In design' in a team-managed project, it should be assigned to the team's designer automatically. Which rule should be used?","zh":"在 team-managed project，issue 移到「In design」時要自動指派給團隊設計師。應使用哪個 rule？","zo":["Assign a work item to someone","Restrict who can move a work item","Restrict to when a work item has been through a status","Validate that people have a specific permission"],"fig":"","opts":["Assign a work item to someone","Restrict who can move a work item","Restrict to when a work item has been through a status","Validate that people have a specific permission"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方範例：移到 In design 時指派給設計師。","B":"錯。是限制，不是指派。","C":"錯。是限制流程。","D":"錯。是驗證權限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/available-workflow-rules-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.4.2-e13","sec":"120.4.2","dom":"120.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements about statuses in team-managed projects are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"關於 team-managed project 的 status，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["Status 與 company-managed project 共用","刪除 status 會刪除其中的 issue","只有 Jira admin 能建立 status","每個 status 都有 To do、In progress 或 Done 的 category","在 board 加欄位會建立 status"],"fig":"","opts":["Statuses are shared with company-managed projects","Deleting a status deletes its issues","Only Jira admins can create statuses","Each status has a category of To do, In progress, or Done","Adding a column to the board creates a status"],"ans":"DE","why":{"A":"錯。TMP 的 status 屬於自己。","B":"錯。刪除時要選把 issue 移到哪個 status。","C":"錯。Project admin 就能建立。","D":"對。Category 決定 board 與報表的分類。","E":"對。TMP 的 board 欄位與 status 連動。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-edit-and-delete-statuses-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.4.2-e14","sec":"120.4.2","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In a team-managed project, a 'Blocked' status should be reachable from any status. What should the project admin configure?","zh":"在 team-managed project，「Blocked」status 要能從任何 status 進入。Project admin 應設定什麼？","zo":["Workflow scheme 中的 condition","Post function","新的 board","設定允許所有 status 轉入 Blocked 的 transition"],"fig":"","opts":["A condition in a workflow scheme","A post function","A new board","A transition that allows all statuses to transition to Blocked"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。TMP 沒有 workflow scheme。","B":"錯。Post function 是 CMP 的概念，也不建立路徑。","C":"錯。不需要新 board。","D":"對。TMP 的 transition 可設定為所有 status 都能轉入。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-edit-and-delete-transitions-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.4.3-e15","sec":"120.4.3","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"When a Story is transitioned to Done, all its sub-tasks should be transitioned to Done too. Which rule structure fits?","zh":"Story 轉到 Done 時，其所有 sub-task 也要轉到 Done。哪個 rule 結構適合？","zo":["只有 Action：轉換 sub-task，不用 branch","Trigger：Work item transitioned → Branch：For sub-tasks → Action：Transition to Done","Trigger：Scheduled → Action：轉換所有 issue","Trigger：Work item created → Condition：有 sub-task"],"fig":"","opts":["Action only: Transition sub-tasks, without a branch","Trigger: Work item transitioned → Branch: For sub-tasks → Action: Transition to Done","Trigger: Scheduled → Action: Transition all issues","Trigger: Work item created → Condition: sub-tasks exist"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。要用 branch 才能作用在相關 issue。","B":"對。用 branch 對每個 sub-task 執行轉換。","C":"錯。排程不會在 Story 轉 Done 時立即執行，也會影響所有 issue。","D":"錯。建立時觸發不符需求。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-branches/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.4.3-e16","sec":"120.4.3","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project admin wants one automation rule to run across five projects. What is true?","zh":"Project admin 希望一條 automation rule 在五個 project 執行。何者正確？","zo":["Rule 只能在一個 project 執行","每個 project 都要複製一份 rule","要由 Jira admin 建立成 multi-project（global）rule","Project admin 可以把 scope 設為多個 project"],"fig":"","opts":["Rules can only run in one project","Each project must copy the rule","A Jira admin must create it as a multi-project (global) rule","The project admin can set the scope to multiple projects"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Global rule 可跨 project。","B":"錯。不必複製。","C":"對。多 project 或 global scope 要 Jira admin。","D":"錯。Project admin 只能建單一 project 的 rule。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-are-rule-details-in-atlassian-automation/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.4.3-e17","sec":"120.4.3","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An automation rule fails with a permission error when transitioning issues in the Payroll project. The permission scheme was recently tightened. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Automation rule 在 Payroll project 轉換 issue 時出現權限錯誤。最近 permission scheme 被收緊了。最可能的原因？","zo":["Rule 的 actor 不再擁有必要的 project 權限","Automation 會忽略權限","Rule 的 condition 太多","Trigger 必須是 scheduled"],"fig":"","opts":["The rule actor no longer has the required project permissions","Automation ignores permissions","The rule has too many conditions","The trigger must be scheduled"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Rule 以 actor 執行，actor 缺 Transition 等權限就會失敗。","B":"錯。Automation 受權限限制。","C":"錯。Condition 數量與權限無關。","D":"錯。Trigger 類型與權限無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/permissions-required-for-jira-cloud-automation-rules/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.4.3-e18","sec":"120.4.3","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In a branch for linked issues, an action must reference the summary of the issue that started the rule. Which smart value should be used?","zh":"在處理 linked issues 的 branch 中，action 要引用觸發 rule 的那張 issue 的 summary。應使用哪個 smart value？","zo":["{{issue.summary}}","{{parent.summary}}","{{now.summary}}","{{triggerIssue.summary}}"],"fig":"","opts":["{{issue.summary}}","{{parent.summary}}","{{now.summary}}","{{triggerIssue.summary}}"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。在 branch 中 {{issue}} 指目前 branch 處理的 issue。","B":"錯。parent 不一定是觸發 issue。","C":"錯。不存在。","D":"對。在 branch 中，{{triggerIssue}} 指觸發 rule 的原始 issue。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/smart-values-in-jira-automation/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.4.3-e19","sec":"120.4.3","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"High-priority issues should post a Slack message, and all other issues should get a comment, in one rule. What should be used?","zh":"同一條 rule 中，高優先 issue 要發 Slack 訊息，其他 issue 則加留言。應使用什麼？","zo":["兩個 trigger","For sub-tasks branch","Scheduled trigger","If/else block"],"fig":"","opts":["Two triggers","A branch for sub-tasks","A scheduled trigger","An If/else block"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。一條 rule 只能一個 trigger。","B":"錯。與 sub-task 無關。","C":"錯。不需要排程。","D":"對。If/else 依條件執行不同動作。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-conditions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.4.3-e20","sec":"120.4.3","dom":"120.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which are valid branch targets in Jira automation? (Choose two.)","zh":"哪些是 Jira automation 有效的 branch 目標？（選兩個）","zo":["Board columns","Linked issues","Sub-tasks","Dashboards","Permission schemes"],"fig":"","opts":["Board columns","Linked issues","Sub-tasks","Dashboards","Permission schemes"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。不是。","B":"對。可以對 linked issues 分支。","C":"對。可以對 sub-tasks 分支。","D":"錯。不是 branch 目標。","E":"錯。不是。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-branches/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.4.3-e21","sec":"120.4.3","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"By default, changes made by an automation rule appear in issue history as made by whom?","zh":"預設情況下，automation rule 做的變更在 issue history 中顯示為誰做的？","zo":["建立站台的 Jira admin","Automation for Jira","Rule owner","Project lead"],"fig":"","opts":["The Jira admin who created the site","Automation for Jira","The rule owner","The project lead"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。不是。","B":"對。預設 actor 是 Automation for Jira。","C":"錯。Owner 收錯誤通知，不是預設 actor。","D":"錯。不是。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-is-a-rule-actor/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.5.1-e01","sec":"120.5.1","dom":"120.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The 'managers' group is a recipient of Issue Commented in the notification scheme, but Leo, a manager, doesn't receive emails for comments on HR issues that use a restricted security level. Why?","zh":"Notification scheme 中「managers」group 是 Issue Commented 的收件人，但經理 Leo 收不到 HR issue（使用受限 security level）的留言通知。為什麼？","zo":["留言永遠不會觸發通知","Leo 必須是 project lead","因為 issue security level，Leo 無法瀏覽這些 issue","Notification scheme 不能使用 group"],"fig":"","opts":["Comments never trigger notifications","Leo must be the project lead","Leo can't browse those issues because of the issue security level","Notification schemes can't use groups"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Issue Commented 會觸發。","B":"錯。不需要。","C":"對。收件人必須看得到 issue；security level 不含他就不會寄。","D":"錯。Scheme 可以用 group。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-notification-schemes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.5.1-e02","sec":"120.5.1","dom":"120.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Only when an issue transitions to 'Escalated' should the support managers group be emailed. Which configuration is required? (Choose two.)","zh":"只有在 issue 轉到「Escalated」時，才寄 email 給 support managers group。需要哪些設定？（選兩個）","zo":["在 notification scheme 把 managers group 設為該 custom event 的收件人","把 managers 加到 Issue Updated","給 managers Browse users and groups","在 Escalate transition 加 validator","建立 custom event，並由 Escalate transition 的 post function 觸發"],"fig":"","opts":["Add the managers group as recipient of that custom event in the notification scheme","Add managers to Issue Updated","Give managers Browse users and groups","Add a validator to the Escalate transition","Create a custom event and fire it from the Escalate transition's post function"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。Notification scheme 為該 event 設收件人。","B":"錯。Issue Updated 會在許多變更時寄。","C":"錯。與通知無關。","D":"錯。Validator 不寄信。","E":"對。Custom event 由 transition 的 post function 觸發。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-a-custom-event/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.5.1-e03","sec":"120.5.1","dom":"120.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Who can edit a notification scheme used by company-managed projects?","zh":"誰能編輯 company-managed project 使用的 notification scheme？","zo":["任何 watcher","Jira admin","任何 project admin","Project lead"],"fig":"","opts":["Any watcher","A Jira admin","Any project admin","The project lead"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。不是。","B":"對。Notification scheme 是全站設定，要 Jira admin。","C":"錯。Project admin 只能看。","D":"錯。不是。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-notification-schemes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.5.2-e04","sec":"120.5.2","dom":"120.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In a team-managed project, the Scrum master should be emailed when any work item is deleted. Who configures this and where?","zh":"在 team-managed project，任何 work item 被刪除時要寄信給 Scrum master。誰設定？在哪裡？","zo":["Project admin，在 Space settings > Notifications","Jira admin，在 notification scheme","每位使用者，在個人設定","Org admin，在 Atlassian Administration"],"fig":"","opts":["The project admin, in Space settings > Notifications","A Jira admin, in a notification scheme","Each user, in personal settings","An org admin, in Atlassian Administration"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。TMP 的通知由 project admin 在 project 設定。","B":"錯。TMP 沒有 notification scheme。","C":"錯。個人設定只能過濾自己的通知。","D":"錯。不是 org admin 的工作。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-notifications-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.5.2-e05","sec":"120.5.2","dom":"120.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which recipients can be selected for team-managed project notifications? (Choose two.)","zh":"Team-managed project 的通知可以選哪些收件人？（選兩個）","zo":["Group custom field value","匿名使用者","Project role","All watchers","User custom field value"],"fig":"","opts":["A group custom field value","Anonymous users","A project role","All watchers","A user custom field value"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。不包含 group custom field。","B":"錯。不能。","C":"對。可以選 project role。","D":"對。可以選 all watchers。","E":"錯。TMP 的收件人不包含 user custom field。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-notifications-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.5.2-e06","sec":"120.5.2","dom":"120.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project admin deletes the 'Reviewer' role in a team-managed project. What happens to notifications that sent emails to that role?","zh":"Project admin 在 team-managed project 刪除了「Reviewer」role。原本寄給該 role 的通知會怎樣？","zo":["自動改寄給 Member role","自動被刪除","照常運作","失效，應手動移除"],"fig":"","opts":["They're automatically moved to the Member role","They're automatically deleted","They keep working","They stop working and should be removed manually"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。不會自動轉移。","B":"錯。不會自動刪除。","C":"錯。不會繼續運作。","D":"對。官方：刪除 role 後相關通知失效，要手動移除。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-notifications-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.5.3-e07","sec":"120.5.3","dom":"120.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Mia is a watcher, and the notification scheme notifies all watchers of comments, but she gets no emails. Her permissions are fine. What should be checked?","zh":"Mia 是 watcher，notification scheme 也設定通知所有 watcher 留言，但她收不到任何信。她的權限沒問題。應檢查什麼？","zo":["Mia 的個人通知設定","Project 的 issue type scheme","Board filter","SLA calendar"],"fig":"","opts":["Mia's personal notification settings","The project's issue type scheme","The board filter","The SLA calendar"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。個人設定可能關掉了 watching 的 email 或整個 issue 活動 email。","B":"錯。無關。","C":"錯。無關。","D":"錯。無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-your-jira-personal-settings/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.5.3-e08","sec":"120.5.3","dom":"120.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements about personal notification settings are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"關於個人通知設定，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["它可以覆蓋 issue security","不能針對 project 客製","它是疊在 admin 通知設定之上的濾網","使用者可以關掉自己是 reporter 的 work item email","使用者可以收到 admin 沒設定的通知"],"fig":"","opts":["They override issue security","They can't be customized per project","They act as a filter on top of the admin's notification settings","Users can turn off email for work items where they're the reporter","Users can receive notifications the admin hasn't configured"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。不能繞過權限。","B":"錯。可以針對最多 50 個 space 客製。","C":"對。官方：個人設定像濾網。","D":"對。可以選擇不收自己是 reporter 的通知。","E":"錯。不能多收。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-your-jira-personal-settings/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.5.3-e09","sec":"120.5.3","dom":"120.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user wants to automatically become a watcher of every issue they create or comment on. Which setting does this?","zh":"使用者希望自己建立或留言的每張 issue 都自動成為 watcher。哪個設定能做到？","zo":["個人 General settings 的 Watch your work items","Notify me of my own changes","Browse users and groups","Filter subscription"],"fig":"","opts":["Watch your work items in personal general settings","Notify me of my own changes","Browse users and groups","A filter subscription"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。開啟後自己建立或留言的 issue 會自動 watch。","B":"錯。那是讓自己的變更也通知自己。","C":"錯。權限無關。","D":"錯。訂閱 filter 不會 watch issue。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-your-jira-personal-settings/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.5.4-e10","sec":"120.5.4","dom":"120.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Emails from customers who aren't Jira users are ignored by the mail handler. What should be configured?","zh":"Mail handler 忽略了不是 Jira 使用者的客戶來信。應該設定什麼？","zo":["Bulk = accept","在目標 project 有建立權限的 Default reporter","Catch email address","Strip quotes"],"fig":"","opts":["Bulk = accept","A Default reporter with permission to create issues in the target project","Catch email address","Strip quotes"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。只影響自動寄出的 bulk 信。","B":"對。寄件人不是使用者時以 default reporter 建立，原寄件人會寫在 description。","C":"錯。只過濾收件別名。","D":"錯。只移除引用文字。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/create-issues-and-comments-from-email/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.5.4-e11","sec":"120.5.4","dom":"120.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"With 'CC assignee' enabled, an email is sent To: jira@company.com, CC: nobody@external.com (not a user), BCC: mia@company.com (a user). Who becomes the assignee?","zh":"開啟「CC assignee」後，email 寄給 To：jira@company.com、CC：nobody@external.com（非使用者）、BCC：mia@company.com（使用者）。誰會被指派？","zo":["Mia，因為 CC 與 To 都沒有有效使用者，所以會看 BCC","nobody@external.com","沒有人，因為 CC 無效","Default reporter"],"fig":"","opts":["Mia, because no valid user is in CC or To, so BCC is checked","nobody@external.com","No one, because CC is invalid","The default reporter"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。依序看 CC → To → BCC 中第一個有效使用者。","B":"錯。不是 Jira 使用者。","C":"錯。CC 無效時會繼續找 To 與 BCC。","D":"錯。Default reporter 是 reporter，不是 assignee。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/create-issues-and-comments-from-email/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.5.4-e12","sec":"120.5.4","dom":"120.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A reply email with the subject 'Re: [OPS-142] Server down' arrives at a 'Create a new issue or add a comment' handler. What happens?","zh":"主旨為「Re: [OPS-142] Server down」的回信送到「Create a new issue or add a comment」handler。會怎樣？","zo":["建立一張新 issue","Email 被忽略","OPS-142 被關閉","Email 被加為 OPS-142 的留言"],"fig":"","opts":["A new issue is created","The email is ignored","OPS-142 is closed","The email is added as a comment on OPS-142"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。沒有 key 時才建新 issue。","B":"錯。不會忽略。","C":"錯。不會轉換 status。","D":"對。主旨有 issue key 時留言到該 issue。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/create-issues-and-comments-from-email/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.6.1-e01","sec":"120.6.1","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A manager wants WEB project issues that are either High priority or labeled 'urgent'. Which JQL is correct?","zh":"經理想要 WEB project 中「High priority 或有 urgent label」的 issue。哪段 JQL 正確？","zo":["(project = WEB AND priority = High) OR labels = urgent","project = WEB AND (priority = High OR labels = urgent)","project = WEB AND priority = High OR labels = urgent","project = WEB OR priority = High AND labels = urgent"],"fig":"","opts":["(project = WEB AND priority = High) OR labels = urgent","project = WEB AND (priority = High OR labels = urgent)","project = WEB AND priority = High OR labels = urgent","project = WEB OR priority = High AND labels = urgent"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。與 B 相同，會包含其他 project 的 urgent issue。","B":"對。括號讓 OR 只作用在 priority 與 labels，並限定 WEB。","C":"錯。AND 先於 OR，會把其他 project 的 urgent issue 也找出來。","D":"錯。邏輯完全不同。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-keywords/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.6.1-e02","sec":"120.6.1","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which JQL returns issues created last calendar month?","zh":"哪段 JQL 能找出上個日曆月建立的 issue？","zo":["created >= -30d","created = lastMonth()","created > endOfMonth(-1)","created >= startOfMonth(-1) AND created < startOfMonth()"],"fig":"","opts":["created >= -30d","created = lastMonth()","created > endOfMonth(-1)","created >= startOfMonth(-1) AND created < startOfMonth()"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。過去 30 天不等於上個日曆月。","B":"錯。沒有這個函數。","C":"錯。這是本月開始之後。","D":"對。上個月第一天起、到本月第一天之前。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.6.1-e03","sec":"120.6.1","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which JQL finds issues whose priority was ever High, including issues created as High and never changed?","zh":"哪段 JQL 能找出 priority 曾經是 High 的 issue（包含建立時就是 High、從未改過的）？","zo":["priority CHANGED TO High","priority = High","priority CHANGED FROM High","priority WAS High"],"fig":"","opts":["priority CHANGED TO High","priority = High","priority CHANGED FROM High","priority WAS High"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。CHANGED 只找有改過的，建立時就是 High 的會漏。","B":"錯。只找目前是 High 的。","C":"錯。只找從 High 改走的。","D":"對。WAS 包含目前與過去的值，含建立時的值。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.6.1-e04","sec":"120.6.1","dom":"120.6","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements describe limitations of basic search compared with JQL? (Choose two.)","zh":"與 JQL 相比，basic search 有哪些限制？（選兩個）","zo":["Basic search 不能存成 filter","Basic search 不能用 OR 組合不同欄位的條件","Basic search 不能用 WAS 或 CHANGED 等歷史 operator","Basic search 不能篩選 project","Basic search 不能篩選 status"],"fig":"","opts":["Basic search can't save filters","Basic search can't combine conditions across different fields with OR","Basic search can't use history operators like WAS or CHANGED","Basic search can't filter by project","Basic search can't filter by status"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。可以存成 filter。","B":"對。跨欄位 OR 需要 JQL。","C":"對。歷史查詢需要 JQL。","D":"錯。可以選 project。","E":"錯。可以選 status。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/perform-a-basic-search/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.6.1-e05","sec":"120.6.1","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which JQL lists overdue, unresolved issues assigned to members of the 'support' group?","zh":"哪段 JQL 能列出指派給「support」group 成員、已過期且未解決的 issue？","zo":["assignee IN membersOf(\"support\") AND status = Done","assignee IN membersOf(\"support\") AND duedate < now() AND resolution = Unresolved","assignee = support AND duedate < now()","group = support AND status != Done"],"fig":"","opts":["assignee IN membersOf(\"support\") AND status = Done","assignee IN membersOf(\"support\") AND duedate < now() AND resolution = Unresolved","assignee = support AND duedate < now()","group = support AND status != Done"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。找的是已完成的。","B":"對。membersOf 取 group 成員，duedate < now() 為過期，resolution = Unresolved 為未解決。","C":"錯。support 是 group 不是使用者，也漏了未解決。","D":"錯。沒有 group 欄位；status != Done 也不等於未解決。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.6.1-e06","sec":"120.6.1","dom":"120.6","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"How can a custom field named 'Story Points' be referenced in JQL? (Choose two.)","zh":"JQL 中可以用哪些方式引用名為「Story Points」的 custom field？（選兩個）","zo":["storypoints() > 5","field.StoryPoints > 5","\"Story Points\" > 5","cf[10016] > 5（使用欄位 ID）","Story_Points > 5"],"fig":"","opts":["storypoints() > 5","field.StoryPoints > 5","\"Story Points\" > 5","cf[10016] > 5 (using its field ID)","Story_Points > 5"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。不是 function。","B":"錯。不是 JQL 語法。","C":"對。有空白的欄位名稱要加引號。","D":"對。也可以用 cf[欄位 ID]。","E":"錯。不能自行改名。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-fields/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.6.2-e07","sec":"120.6.2","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A filter using 'assignee = currentUser()' is subscribed to the 'support' group. What does each member receive?","zh":"使用「assignee = currentUser()」的 filter 被訂閱給「support」group。每位成員會收到什麼？","zo":["不管 assignee，filter 中所有 issue","什麼都沒有，因為 currentUser() 在訂閱中無效","指派給自己的 issue","指派給 filter 擁有者的 issue"],"fig":"","opts":["All issues in the filter regardless of assignee","Nothing, because currentUser() doesn't work in subscriptions","Issues assigned to themselves","Issues assigned to the filter owner"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。仍套用條件。","B":"錯。可以運作。","C":"對。訂閱時 currentUser() 依每位收件人分別計算。","D":"錯。不是依建立者計算。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/work-with-search-results/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.6.2-e08","sec":"120.6.2","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team lead can't create a filter subscription for the 'qa-team' group, but can subscribe herself. What is missing?","zh":"Team lead 能訂閱給自己，卻無法替「qa-team」group 建立 filter subscription。缺少什麼？","zo":["Share dashboards and filters","Browse users and groups","Administer Projects","Manage group filter subscriptions 全域權限"],"fig":"","opts":["Share dashboards and filters","Browse users and groups","Administer Projects","Manage group filter subscriptions global permission"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。那是分享權限。","B":"錯。與訂閱無關。","C":"錯。不是 project 權限問題。","D":"對。訂閱給 group 需要這個全域權限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.6.2-e09","sec":"120.6.2","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A dashboard is shared with the Sales group, but some Sales members see empty gadgets. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Dashboard 分享給 Sales group，但部分 Sales 成員看到的 gadget 是空的。最可能的原因？","zo":["Dashboard 只能分享給個人","Gadget 需要 Administer Jira","Dashboard 必須是 default dashboard","他們對 gadget filter 中的 project 沒有 Browse 權限"],"fig":"","opts":["Dashboards can only be shared with individuals","Gadgets require Administer Jira","The dashboard must be the default dashboard","They lack Browse permission on the projects in the gadget's filter"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。可以分享給 group。","B":"錯。不需要。","C":"錯。不需要。","D":"對。被分享的人只看得到自己有權限的 issue。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/save-your-search-as-a-filter/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.6.2-e10","sec":"120.6.2","dom":"120.6","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A subscription should send an email every weekday at 9:00 even when the filter returns no issues. Which settings are needed? (Choose two.)","zh":"訂閱要在每個工作日 9:00 寄信，即使 filter 沒有結果也要寄。需要哪些設定？（選兩個）","zo":["勾選「Email this filter even if there are no issues found」","公開分享 filter","把 filter 加到 dashboard","給 Make bulk changes","排程：Days per week，週一到週五，9:00"],"fig":"","opts":["Select 'Email this filter even if there are no issues found'","Share the filter publicly","Add the filter to a dashboard","Grant Make bulk changes","Schedule: days per week, Monday to Friday, at 9:00"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。預設沒結果不寄，要勾這個。","B":"錯。不需要公開。","C":"錯。與訂閱無關。","D":"錯。無關。","E":"對。依週間排程。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/work-with-search-results/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.6.2-e11","sec":"120.6.2","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which global permission is required to share a filter with a group?","zh":"把 filter 分享給 group 需要哪個全域權限？","zo":["Manage group filter subscriptions","Browse users and groups","Make bulk changes","Share dashboards and filters"],"fig":"","opts":["Manage group filter subscriptions","Browse users and groups","Make bulk changes","Share dashboards and filters"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。那是訂閱給 group。","B":"錯。無關。","C":"錯。無關。","D":"對。分享 filter 與 dashboard 需要這個權限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.6.2-e12","sec":"120.6.2","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A report must be emailed on the last business day of every month. Which subscription schedule option fits?","zh":"報表要在每月最後一個工作天寄出。哪個訂閱排程適合？","zo":["Daily","Days per week","Hourly","Advanced（cron 表達式）"],"fig":"","opts":["Daily","Days per week","Hourly","Advanced (cron expression)"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。每天會寄太多。","B":"錯。週間排程無法表達月底最後一個工作天。","C":"錯。沒有這個需求。","D":"對。複雜排程用 advanced（cron）。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/work-with-search-results/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.6.3-e13","sec":"120.6.3","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user has Make bulk changes but the 'Move issues' option is unavailable for issues in project HR. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"使用者有 Make bulk changes，但 HR project 的 issue 沒有「Move issues」選項。最可能的原因？","zo":["Bulk move 需要 Administer Jira","Move 上限 100 個 issue","Move 只能用於 team-managed project","他在 HR 缺少 Move Issues 權限（或在目標 project 缺少 Create Issues）"],"fig":"","opts":["Bulk move requires Administer Jira","Move is limited to 100 issues","Move is only available for team-managed projects","They lack the Move Issues permission in HR (or Create Issues in the destination)"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。不需要 Jira admin。","B":"錯。上限是 1,000。","C":"錯。兩種 project 都可以。","D":"對。Bulk 還要每個動作對應的 project 權限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.6.3-e14","sec":"120.6.3","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin bulk-edits 300 issues, choosing 'Replace all with' for Labels with the value 'archived'. What happens to existing labels?","zh":"Admin 對 300 張 issue 做 bulk edit，Labels 選「Replace all with」並填「archived」。原本的 label 會怎樣？","zo":["只更新沒有 label 的 issue","被移除並換成「archived」","加上「archived」並保留原 label","沒有變化"],"fig":"","opts":["Only issues without labels are updated","They are removed and replaced by 'archived'","'archived' is added, keeping existing labels","Nothing changes"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。全部都會更新。","B":"對。Replace all with 會清掉原值。","C":"錯。那是 Add to existing。","D":"錯。會變更。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.6.3-e15","sec":"120.6.3","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Selected issues use two different workflows. What happens when the user chooses to bulk transition them?","zh":"選取的 issue 使用兩種不同 workflow。使用者選擇 bulk transition 時會怎樣？","zo":["依 workflow 分組，一次轉換一組","全部一起轉換","整個操作被擋下","Jira 把它們轉成同一個 workflow"],"fig":"","opts":["Issues are grouped by workflow and transitioned one group at a time","All issues transition together","The operation is blocked entirely","Jira converts them to the same workflow"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：不同 workflow 要分組，一次一組。","B":"錯。不能一起轉換。","C":"錯。不是完全擋下。","D":"錯。不會改 workflow。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.6.3-e16","sec":"120.6.3","dom":"120.6","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Issues are bulk-moved from a company-managed project to a team-managed project. Which data is permanently lost? (Choose two.)","zh":"把 issue 從 company-managed project bulk move 到 team-managed project。哪些資料會永久遺失？（選兩個）","zo":["Comments","Components","Versions","Summary","Description"],"fig":"","opts":["Comments","Components","Versions","Summary","Description"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。會保留。","B":"對。官方：components 不會保留。","C":"對。官方：version 資訊不會保留。","D":"錯。會保留。","E":"錯。會保留。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/migrate-between-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.6.3-e17","sec":"120.6.3","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin wants to bulk-edit 2,500 issues at once. What is true?","zh":"Admin 想一次 bulk edit 2,500 張 issue。何者正確？","zo":["上限是 100","只有 Jira admin 能一次超過 1,000","Bulk 操作一次最多 1,000 張","沒有上限"],"fig":"","opts":["The limit is 100","Only Jira admins can bulk edit more than 1,000","Bulk operations are limited to 1,000 issues at a time","There's no limit"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。上限是 1,000。","B":"錯。上限對所有人都一樣。","C":"對。一次最多 1,000 個。","D":"錯。有上限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.6.3-e18","sec":"120.6.3","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"During a large bulk edit, the admin wants to avoid flooding watchers with emails. What can be done?","zh":"大量 bulk edit 時，admin 想避免大量 email 寄給 watcher。可以怎麼做？","zo":["在可用時取消勾選「Send mail for this update」","先移除所有 watcher","永久停用 notification scheme","逐張編輯"],"fig":"","opts":["Clear 'Send mail for this update' when available","Remove all watchers first","Disable the notification scheme permanently","Edit issues one by one"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：可以取消勾選以避免通知轟炸。","B":"錯。不必要且會失去 watcher。","C":"錯。過度且影響日常通知。","D":"錯。不切實際。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.7.1-e01","sec":"120.7.1","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira admin changes the user default email format from HTML to Text. Existing users still receive HTML emails. Why?","zh":"Jira admin 把使用者預設 email 格式從 HTML 改成 Text，既有使用者仍收到 HTML。為什麼？","zo":["Email 格式不能改","Notification scheme 覆蓋了它","使用者要先登出","User default settings 只套用到新使用者，除非 admin 把變更套用到既有使用者"],"fig":"","opts":["Email format can't be changed","The notification scheme overrides it","Users need to log out first","User default settings apply to new users unless the admin applies the change to existing users"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。可以改。","B":"錯。Notification scheme 不決定格式。","C":"錯。不需要。","D":"對。預設只影響之後的新使用者；要套用到既有使用者需按 Apply（或使用者自己改）。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-the-user-default-settings/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.7.1-e02","sec":"120.7.1","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A planned maintenance notice must appear at the top of Jira for everyone, including anonymous visitors to public projects. What should be configured?","zh":"計畫性維護公告必須出現在 Jira 頂端給所有人看，包括瀏覽公開 project 的匿名訪客。應設定什麼？","zo":["Private announcement banner","Dashboard gadget","Filter subscription","Public announcement banner"],"fig":"","opts":["A private announcement banner","A dashboard gadget","A filter subscription","A public announcement banner"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Private 只給登入者。","B":"錯。Dashboard 不在每頁頂端。","C":"錯。訂閱是寄信。","D":"對。Public banner 所有人（含匿名）都看得到。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-the-look-and-feel-of-jira-applications/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.7.1-e03","sec":"120.7.1","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Users who haven't created their own dashboard should see a company-wide set of gadgets. Who can configure this and where?","zh":"還沒建立自己 dashboard 的使用者，應看到全公司一致的 gadget。誰能設定？在哪裡？","zo":["每位使用者，在個人設定","Org admin，在 Atlassian Administration","Jira admin，編輯 default（system）dashboard","任何 project admin，在 Project settings"],"fig":"","opts":["Each user, in personal settings","An org admin, in Atlassian Administration","A Jira admin, by editing the default (system) dashboard","Any project admin, from Project settings"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。個人只能改自己的。","B":"錯。不在 Atlassian Administration。","C":"對。Default dashboard 由 Jira admin 編輯。","D":"錯。Project admin 不能改。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-the-default-dashboard/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.7.1-e04","sec":"120.7.1","dom":"120.7","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements about user default settings and personal settings are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"關於 user default settings 與 personal settings，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["預設值永遠覆蓋個人設定","Personal settings 可以授予權限","預設值只套用到匿名使用者","Personal settings 對該使用者覆蓋預設值","Default settings 由 Jira admin 設定"],"fig":"","opts":["Defaults always override personal settings","Personal settings can grant permissions","Defaults apply only to anonymous users","Personal settings override the defaults for that user","Default settings are configured by a Jira admin"],"ans":"DE","why":{"A":"錯。相反。","B":"錯。不能給權限。","C":"錯。預設也給新使用者。","D":"對。個人設定優先。","E":"對。由 Jira admin 設定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-the-user-default-settings/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.7.2-e05","sec":"120.7.2","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"After a Jira admin changes 'Working hours per day' from 8 to 6, an estimate previously shown as '1d' now displays differently. Why?","zh":"Jira admin 把「Working hours per day」從 8 改成 6 後，原本顯示為「1d」的估計顯示改變了。為什麼？","zo":["Time tracking 被停用","Board 的 estimation 改變了","估計以時間單位儲存，「天」的換算改變了","估計被刪除了"],"fig":"","opts":["Time tracking was disabled","The board estimation changed","Estimates are stored in time units, and the day conversion changed","The estimates were deleted"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。沒有停用。","B":"錯。與 board 無關。","C":"對。估計以時間單位儲存，改 hours per day 會改變「天」的換算顯示。","D":"錯。沒有被刪除。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-time-tracking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.7.2-e06","sec":"120.7.2","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Users with the Link Issues permission can't find the Link option anywhere. Other features work. What should the Jira admin check?","zh":"有 Link Issues 權限的使用者到處都找不到 Link 選項，其他功能正常。Jira admin 應檢查什麼？","zo":["Project 是否有 components","全站是否啟用 issue linking","是否啟用 time tracking","使用者是否有 Browse users and groups"],"fig":"","opts":["Whether the project has components","Whether issue linking is enabled globally","Whether time tracking is enabled","Whether the users have Browse users and groups"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。無關。","B":"對。全站關閉 issue linking 時看不到 Link。","C":"錯。無關。","D":"錯。無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-issue-linking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.7.2-e07","sec":"120.7.2","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira admin disables time tracking for a month, then re-enables it. What happens to previously logged work?","zh":"Jira admin 停用 time tracking 一個月後再重新啟用。之前記錄的工時會怎樣？","zo":["保留，並再次顯示","被永久刪除","轉成 story points","移到留言"],"fig":"","opts":["It is preserved and visible again","It is permanently deleted","It is converted to story points","It is moved to comments"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。停用只是隱藏，重新開啟後資料仍在。","B":"錯。不會刪除。","C":"錯。不會轉換。","D":"錯。不會。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-time-tracking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.7.3-e08","sec":"120.7.3","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira admin renames the status 'In Review' to 'Peer Review' in a company-managed workflow. Which projects see the new name?","zh":"Jira admin 在 company-managed workflow 把 status「In Review」改名為「Peer Review」。哪些 project 會看到新名稱？","zo":["只有編輯 workflow 的那個 project","只有 team-managed project","要重新索引才會","所有 workflow 使用該 status 的 project"],"fig":"","opts":["Only the project where the workflow was edited","Only team-managed projects","None until re-indexing","All projects whose workflows use that status"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。不限單一 project。","B":"錯。TMP 的 status 各自獨立。","C":"錯。不需要。","D":"對。CMP 的 status 是全站物件。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-statuses-resolutions-and-priorities/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.7.3-e09","sec":"120.7.3","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The Support project needs a different set of priorities from the Engineering project. What should the Jira admin use?","zh":"Support project 需要和 Engineering project 不同的 priority 清單。Jira admin 應使用什麼？","zo":["Workflow properties","Priority schemes","Priority 的 field context","兩個 notification scheme"],"fig":"","opts":["Workflow properties","Priority schemes","Field contexts on Priority","Two notification schemes"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。無關。","B":"對。Priority scheme 讓不同 project 用不同 priority 清單。","C":"錯。Priority 是系統欄位，用 priority scheme 管理。","D":"錯。無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-issue-statuses-priorities-and-resolutions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.7.3-e10","sec":"120.7.3","dom":"120.7","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements about renaming statuses are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"關於 status 改名，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["Team-managed 的 status 名稱全站共用","只有 project admin 能改 company-managed 的 status 名稱","在 team-managed project 改 status 名稱只影響該 project","改 company-managed 的 status 名稱會影響所有使用它的 workflow","改 status 名稱會讓所有已存 filter 失效"],"fig":"","opts":["Team-managed status names are shared site-wide","Only project admins can rename company-managed statuses","Renaming a status in a team-managed project affects only that project","Renaming a company-managed status affects all workflows using it","Renaming a status breaks all saved filters"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。不共用。","B":"錯。要 Jira admin。","C":"對。TMP 的 status 屬於自己。","D":"對。CMP 的 status 是全站共用。","E":"錯。Filter 以 ID 儲存，不會壞。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-statuses-resolutions-and-priorities/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-edit-and-delete-statuses-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.7.4-e11","sec":"120.7.4","dom":"120.7","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which data is NOT included in a Jira Cloud backup from Backup manager? (Choose two.)","zh":"Backup manager 產生的 Jira Cloud backup 不包含哪些資料？（選兩個）","zo":["第三方 app 資料","Issue 留言","Workflow 與 scheme","Archived projects","Automation rules"],"fig":"","opts":["Third-party app data","Issue comments","Workflows and schemes","Archived projects","Automation rules"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。第三方 app 資料不包含。","B":"錯。留言包含在內。","C":"錯。設定包含在內。","D":"錯。Archived projects 包含在內。","E":"對。官方：automation rules 不會匯出，要另外匯出匯入。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/export-issues/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.7.4-e12","sec":"120.7.4","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin creates a backup including attachments at 10:00 on Monday and wants another one including attachments at 15:00 the same day. What happens?","zh":"Admin 週一 10:00 建立了含附件的 backup，想在同日 15:00 再建一份含附件的。會怎樣？","zo":["附件永遠不能備份","每月只能備份一次","含附件的 backup 之間必須間隔 48 小時","可以立即建立"],"fig":"","opts":["Attachments can never be backed up","Only one backup per month is allowed","They must wait 48 hours between backups that include attachments","It works immediately"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。可以勾選包含附件。","B":"錯。沒有這種限制。","C":"對。官方：含附件、avatar、logo 時兩次 backup 間隔 48 小時。","D":"錯。含附件有間隔限制。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/export-issues/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"120.7.4-e13","sec":"120.7.4","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin imports a full Jira Cloud backup file into a site that already has active projects. What is the impact?","zh":"Admin 把完整的 Jira Cloud backup 匯入一個已有運作中 project 的站台。影響為何？","zo":["Backup 會與現有 project 合併","只會新增新的 issue","Archived projects 會被略過","站上現有資料被 backup 的資料覆蓋"],"fig":"","opts":["The backup is merged with existing projects","Only new issues are added","Archived projects are skipped","Existing data on the site is overwritten by the backup's data"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。不會合併。","B":"錯。不是只新增。","C":"錯。Archived projects 包含在 backup 中並會還原。","D":"對。匯入完整 backup 會覆蓋現有資料；archived projects 也會一起還原。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/atlassian-cloud/kb/partial-or-selective-import-of-a-jira-backup-export-into-jira-cloud/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1}];